 approximately $2.52 million -> [444]\n$16.30 -> [226]\nvoting agreement with -> [179, 325, 348, 350, 672]\nsecond business day after -> []\nthe Company will pay -> [311, 444]\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"==== para 350 page 29\nIn late July 2016, the Company received six LOIs with offer prices per share ranging from $19.20 to $24.00 (implying equity values of $96 million to $121 million). Party B, G&W and another bidder (“Party D”) also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement. One bidder (“Party E”) provided a summary of material issues and proposed changes to the merger agreement and voting agreement with respect to those issues.\n==== para 352 page 30\nIn addition to various due diligence requirements, the LOI prices were based on different assumptions and requirements related to transaction expenses and change in control payments, which GHF and the Transaction Committee observed could affect the ultimate offer price. One strategic buyer and one financial buyer elected not to submit an LOI.\n25 of whom -> []\n53% premium -> []\nabsence of a financing condition -> []\nwhich was the last trading day -> [226]\naggregate fee of approximately $2.52 million -> [444]\n$16.30 -> [226]\nvoting agreement with -> [179, 325, 348, 350, 672]\nsecond business day after -> []\nthe Company will pay -> [311, 444]\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport json\\nout = json.load(open('paras.json'))\\n# print full text for background paras 350-352 and find key quotes\\nfor i in [350,352]:\\n    print('==== para', i, 'page', out[i][0])\\n    print(out[i][1])\\n# find paragraphs containing key strings\\nkeys = [\\\"25 of whom\\\", \\\"53% premium\\\", \\\"absence of a financing condition\\\", \\\"which was the last trading day\\\", \\\"aggregate fee of approximately $2.52 million\\\", \\\"$16.30\\\", \\\"voting agreement with\\\", \\\"second business day after\\\", \\\"the Company will pay\\\"]\\nfor k in keys:\\n    hits = [i for i,(p,t) in enumerate(out) if k.lower() in t.lower()]\\n    print(k, '->', hits[:8])\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824620247,"end":1789824621079}}}}
