nconsideration_ma [870]\n    870 p50 | At the effective time of the merger, each share of preferred stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the merger (other\nconditions [889]\n    889 p52 | either (i) final approval or authorization of, or exemption by, the STB with respect to the merger has been obtained, and neither the STB nor any othe\ntermination_fee [263, 930]\n    263 p8 | Under the terms of the merger agreement, the Company must pay G&W a termination fee of $3,785,000 if:\n    930 p55 | Under the terms of the merger agreement, the Company must pay G&W a termination fee of $3,785,000 if:\nregulatory [1025]\n    1025 p64 | Before G&W may complete the merger and within fifteen business days of the date of the merger agreement, G&W must file with the STB the appropriate do\nvoting [1168]\n    1168 p72 | In connection with the execution of the merger agreement, G&W and the Company entered into a voting agreement with the Robert H. Eder Trust and the Li\ngw_desc [179, 471]\n    179 p1 | G&W, a Delaware corporation, owns or leases 121 freight railroads worldwide that are organized in 10 operating regions with approximately 7,200 employ\n    471 p21 | G&W, a Delaware corporation, owns or leases 121 freight railroads worldwide that are organized in 10 operating regions with approximately 7,200 employ\noutside_date [260, 261, 266, 922]\n    260 p8 | by G&W or the Company, if the merger is not completed by December 31, 2016 (or, if the only unsatisfied condition is STB approval of the merger, by Fe\n    261 p8 | by G&W or the Company, if the other party materially breaches any of its representations, warranties, covenants or agreements contained in the merger \nsummary_consideration [223]\n    223 p5 | If the merger is completed, at the effective time of the merger, each issued and outstanding share of preferred stock immediately prior to the effecti\nmgmt_consideration [870]\n    870 p50 | At the effective time of the merger, each share of preferred stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the merger (other\nlitigation [146, 1027]\n    146 p1 | Transaction Litigation\n    1027 p65 | Transaction Litigation\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"proposal_general [547]\n    547 p27 | Under the terms and conditions set forth in the merger agreement, Merger Sub will merge with and into the Company, with the Company being the survivin\nconsideration_ma [870]\n    870 p50 | At the effective time of the merger, each share of preferred stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the merger (other\nconditions [889]\n    889 p52 | either (i) final approval or authorization of, or exemption by, the STB with respect to the merger has been obtained, and neither the STB nor any othe\ntermination_fee [263, 930]\n    263 p8 | Under the terms of the merger agreement, the Company must pay G&W a termination fee of $3,785,000 if:\n    930 p55 | Under the terms of the merger agreement, the Company must pay G&W a termination fee of $3,785,000 if:\nregulatory [1025]\n    1025 p64 | Before G&W may complete the merger and within fifteen business days of the date of the merger agreement, G&W must file with the STB the appropriate do\nvoting [1168]\n    1168 p72 | In connection with the execution of the merger agreement, G&W and the Company entered into a voting agreement with the Robert H. Eder Trust and the Li\ngw_desc [179, 471]\n    179 p1 | G&W, a Delaware corporation, owns or leases 121 freight railroads worldwide that are organized in 10 operating regions with approximately 7,200 employ\n    471 p21 | G&W, a Delaware corporation, owns or leases 121 freight railroads worldwide that are organized in 10 operating regions with approximately 7,200 employ\noutside_date [260, 261, 266, 922]\n    260 p8 | by G&W or the Company, if the merger is not completed by December 31, 2016 (or, if the only unsatisfied condition is STB approval of the merger, by Fe\n    261 p8 | by G&W or the Company, if the other party materially breaches any of its representations, warranties, covenants or agreements contained in the merger \nsummary_consideration [223]\n    223 p5 | If the merger is completed, at the effective time of the merger, each issued and outstanding share of preferred stock immediately prior to the effecti\nmgmt_consideration [870]\n    870 p50 | At the effective time of the merger, each share of preferred stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the merger (other\nlitigation [146, 1027]\n    146 p1 | Transaction Litigation\n    1027 p65 | Transaction Litigation\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport json, re\\nout = json.load(open('blocks_pages.json'))\\n# find specific blocks\\ndef find(pat, n=4):\\n    return [i for i,(p,t) in enumerate(out) if re.search(pat, t)][:n]\\npats = {\\n 'proposal_general': r\\\"Under the terms and conditions set forth in the merger agreement, Merger Sub will merge\\\",\\n 'consideration_ma': r\\\"^At the effective time of the merger, each share of preferred stock issued and outstanding\\\",\\n 'conditions': r\\\"either \\\\(i\\\\) final approval or authorization of, or exemption by, the STB\\\",\\n 'termination_fee': r\\\"^Under the terms of the merger agreement, the Company must pay G&W a termination fee of \\\\$3,785,000 if\\\",\\n 'regulatory': r\\\"^Before G&W may complete the merger\\\",\\n 'voting': r\\\"^In connection with the execution of the merger agreement, G&W and the Company entered into a voting agreement\\\",\\n 'gw_desc': r\\\"^G&W, a Delaware corporation\\\",\\n 'outside_date': r\\\"outside date\\\",\\n 'summary_consideration': r\\\"^If the merger is completed, at the effective time of the merger, each issued and outstanding share of preferred stock\\\",\\n 'mgmt_consideration': r\\\"At the effective time of the merger, each share of preferred stock issued and outstanding immediately\\\",\\n 'litigation': r\\\"Transaction Litigation\\\",\\n}\\nfor k,p in pats.items():\\n    hits = find(p)\\n    print(k, hits)\\n    for h in hits[:2]:\\n        print('   ', h, 'p'+out[h][0], '|', out[h][1][:150])\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824744568,"end":1789824745910}}}}
