tted an IOI with an offer price per share of $21.00 (implying an equity value of $108 million).') + ' (P-014, p.29). Convention: IOI with no formal documentation \\u2014 Informal; Heavy by context (no substantive diligence access before the indication, P-014, p.29).',\n    src='P-014', link='P-014', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,12), dto=D(2016,7,12), wdate=D(2016,7,12),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=21.00, phigh=21.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: not stated; DD open: no; Excl: not stated', page=29,\n    related='R026 (catch-up access); R031 (later LOI)', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 26. Party C access\nadd(rid='R026', n=26, when='07/14/2016', who='Party C', what='Information access changed', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Late-entrant catch-up access: after its 07/12/2016 IOI, Party C was provided access to the internet data site and the Company held a management presentation with Party C by telephone. The seven bidders already in the process had received data-site access from 06/01/2016 (R021); no access was withheld from others.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(561, 'Subsequently, Party C was provided access to the internet data site and the Company\\u2019s management held a management presentation with Party C by telephone on July 14, 2016.') + ' (P-014, p.29).',\n    src='P-014', link='P-014', count=None, dfrom=D(2016,7,14), dto=D(2016,7,14), wdate=D(2016,7,14),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=29, related='R021; R025', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 27. LOI deadline milestone\nadd(rid='R027', n=27, when='07/20/2016', who='Company (LOI and mark-up deadline)', what='Deadline', proc=1, rnd='2',\n    terms='Due date for non-binding LOIs and mark-ups. Treatment Late bids accepted: G&W\\u2019s LOI was submitted 07/21/2016 and was reviewed with the others at the 07/22 and 07/27 committee meetings; no revision of the date is reported.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(559, 'by July 20, 2016') + ' (P-012, p.29); ' + q(564, 'G&W submitted an LOI on July 21, 2016 to acquire the Company for a price of $21.15 per share') + ' (P-017, p.29); ' + q(570, 'The Transaction Committee met by telephone conference on July 22, 2016 and in person after the regular quarterly Board meeting on July 27, 2016, to review the LOIs with representatives of GHF.') + ' (P-023, p.30).',\n    src='P-012; P-017; P-023', link='P-012', review='Q2', dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,20), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', duedate=D(2016,7,20), dtreat='Late bids accepted', page=30, related='R022; R035', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 28-32. Late-July LOIs (five undated, working 07/20)\nadd(rid='R028', n=28, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\u201307/27)',\n    who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='$24.00 per share, subject to an expedited diligence review; Party B also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement (formal signal).',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Light',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(563, 'Party B submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $24.00 per share (subject to an expedited diligence review).') + ' (P-016, p.29); mark-ups: ' + q(562, 'Party B, G&W and another bidder (\\u201cParty D\\u201d) also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement.') + ' (P-015, p.29). Convention: undated; window 07/20\\u201307/27 (the 07/27 meeting compared all six LOIs, P-023, p.30), working date = the 07/20 deadline (Assigned: deadline); order relative to G&W\\u2019s 07/21 LOI is not actually known (see R035). Formality Formal (returned agreement mark-ups); conditions Light (only an expedited diligence review attached).',\n    src='P-015; P-016; P-023', link='P-016', review='Q2; Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', 