ed mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement.',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(566, 'Party D (a financial buyer) submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $21.00 per share (subject to a four-week diligence period).') + ' (P-019, p.30); mark-ups (P-015, p.29). Formality Formal (returned agreement mark-ups); conditions Heavy (stated four-week diligence period).',\n    src='P-015; P-019', link='P-019', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=21.00, phigh=21.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (4 wks); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\n    related='R037; R039; R045', deal=DEAL)\nadd(rid='R031', n=31, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\u201307/27)',\n    who='Party C (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='$19.30 per share, subject to a 30-day diligence period (below its 07/12/2016 IOI of $21.00). Count 0 \\u2014 Party C\\u2019s first Round-2 bid is R025; this is a same-round subsequent submission.',\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(567, 'Party C submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $19.30 per share (subject to a 30-day diligence period).') + ' (P-020, p.30). Formality Informal (no mark-up attributed to C; mark-up list names B, G&W, D \\u2014 P-015, p.29); conditions Heavy (stated 30-day diligence period).',\n    src='P-015; P-020', link='P-020', review='Q6; Q7', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=19.30, phigh=19.30, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\n    related='covers R025; R037; R038', deal=DEAL)\nadd(rid='R032', n=32, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\u201307/27)',\n    who='Party F (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='$19.20 per share, subject to a 30-day due diligence period. No mark-up attributed to Party F.',\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(568, 'Party F (a strategic buyer) submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $19.20 per share (subject to a 30-day due diligence period).') + ' (P-021, p.30). Formality Informal (no mark-up attributed; mark-up list names B, G&W, D \\u2014 P-015, p.29); conditions Heavy (stated 30-day diligence period).',\n    src='P-015; P-021', link='P-021', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=19.20, phigh=19.20, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\n    related='R037; R041; R046 (financing support to E)', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 33-34. Non-submitting LOI bidders\nadd(rid='R033', n=33, when='By 07/20/2016 (election reported in late July; no date)',\n    who='Unnamed strategic bidder that elected not to submit an LOI', what='Did not submit', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Stated non-submission: of the bidders in the LOI stage, one strategic buyer elected not to submit. Stage: Round 2. Reason not stated.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(569, 'One strategic buyer and one financial buyer elected not to submit an LOI.') + ' (P-022, p.30). Convention: election undated; working date = the 07/20 deadline (Assigned: deadline). The filing supplies the type split, so the two non-submitters are recorded separately. Overlap with the seven advanced bidders and with Party A is unresolved (Q3).',\n    src='P-022', link='P-022', review='Q3; Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,7,20), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', decidedby='Bidder', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Stated', page=30,\n    related='R021; R037; R042 (possible member)', deal=DEAL)\nadd(rid='R034', n=34, when='By 07/20/2016 (election reported in late July; no date)',\n    who='Unnamed financial bidder that elected not to submit an LOI', what='Did not submit', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Financial',\n    terms='Stated non-submission: of the bidders in the LOI stage, one financial buyer elected not to submit. Stage: Round 2. Reason not stated.',\n    why='Stated. Same quotation as R033 (P-022, p.30). Convention: election undated; working date = the 07/20 deadline (Assigned: deadline).',\n    src='P-022', link='P-022', review='Q3; Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,7,20), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', decidedby='Bidder', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Stated', page=30,\n    related='R021; R037; R042 (possible member)', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 35-36. G&W LOIs\nadd(rid='R035', n=35, when='07/21/2016', who='G&W (Genesee & Wyoming Inc.)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='$21.15 per share: $20.02 cash at closing plus $1.13 in the form of a contingent value right (CVR) based on the subsequent sale of the Company\\u2019s South Quay property; subject to a three-week exclusive diligence period. G&W provided a mark-up of the disclosure letter plus mark-ups of the merger agreement and voting agreement (P-015, p.29). All cash: Yes (the CVR is a contingent cash payment).',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(564, 'G&W submitted an LOI on July 21, 2016 to acquire the Company for a price of $21.15 per share (subject to a three-week exclusive diligence period). The price included $20.02 cash at closing and $1.13 in the form of a contingent value right, the value of which was based on the subsequent sale of the Company\\u2019s South Quay property (\\u201cCVR\\u201d). G&W also provided a mark-up of the disclosure letter.') + ' (P-017, p.29). Formality Formal (bidder-returned agreement mark-ups); conditions Heavy (stated three-week exclusive diligence period).',\n    src='P-015; P-017', link='P-017', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,21), dto=D(2016,7,21), wdate=D(2016,7,21),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=21.15, phigh=21.15, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Yes', cashclose=20.02, conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (3 wks); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (3 wks)', page=29,\n    related='R036; R037', deal=DEAL)\nadd(rid='R036', n=36, when='07/26/2016', who='G&W (Genesee & Wyoming Inc.)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Revised LOI: $22.15 per share (including $21.02 in cash and $1.13 CVR), submitted in response to GHF feedback that G&W\\u2019s price and CVR structure were not competitive. Count 0 \\u2014 same bidder and round as R035. Conditions reassessed: no change reported, so the three-week exclusive diligence condition is carried.',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(564, 'On July 26, 2016, in response to feedback from representatives of GHF indicating its price and CVR structure were not competitive, G&W submitted a revised LOI, which increased its offer to $22.15 per share (including $21.02 in cash and $1.13 CVR).') + ' (P-017, p.29).',\n    src='P-017', link='P-017', review='Q6', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,7,26), dto=D(2016,7,26), wdate=D(2016,7,26),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=22.15, phigh=22.15, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Yes', cashclose=21.02, conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (3 wks); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (3 wks)', page=29,\n    related='revises R035; further revised by R052', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 37. Round 3 opened / selection\nadd(rid='R037', n=37, when='07/27/2016', who='Transaction Committee (after the regular quarterly Board meeting)',\n    what='Round opened', proc=1, rnd='3',\n    terms='Selection: the Committee concluded to proceed with confirmatory due diligence and negotiations with G&W and Party B because of their higher offers; GHF subsequently told the remaining bidders they were no longer involved. Round finality: Inferred final \\u2014 no finality words, but the target moved to definitive negotiation with selected bidders (confirmatory due diligence and completion of the merger agreement). Director Smith (GATX, 4.92% holder) recused.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(570, 'The Transaction Committee concluded that the Company should proceed with confirmatory due diligence and negotiations with G&W and Party B because of the higher offers made by each of G&W and Party B relative to the other potential buyers. At the direction of the Transaction Committee, representatives of GHF subsequently contacted the remaining bidders to inform them that they were no longer involved in the process.') + ' (P-023, p.30).',\n    src='P-023', link='P-023', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,7,27), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,27),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', rfinal='Inferred final', page=30, related='R020; R021; R038\\u2013R042', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 38-41. Dropped C, D, E, F\nfor rid, nm, typ, rnd in [('R038','Party C','Strategic','2'), ('R039','Party D','Financial','2'),\n                          ('R040','Party E','Strategic','2'), ('R041','Party F','Strategic','2')]:\n    add(rid=rid, n=38+['R038','R039','R040','R041'].index(rid), when='07/27/2016 (notice given subsequently)',\n        who=nm, what='Dropped by target', proc=1, rnd=rnd, typ=typ,\n        terms='Told it was no longer involved after the 07/27/2016 selection of G&W and Party B (stated comparative reason: the two continuing bids were higher). Stage left: Round 2.',\n        why='Stated (notice). ' + q(570, 'representatives of GHF subsequently contacted the remaining bidders to inform them that they were no longer involved in the process.') + ' (P-023, p.30). Convention: notice undated; working date = the decision day (Assigned: decision day).',\n        src='P-023', link='P-023', review='Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,27),\n        dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: decision day', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Lower offer than rivals', obasis='Stated',\n        page=30, related='R037', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 42. Party A identity row\nadd(rid='R042', n=42, when='By 07/27/2016', who='Party A', what='Dropped by target', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Inferred: identity \\u2014 Party A is not named in the 07/27/2016 continuing set (G&W and Party B) or in any later event. Could already be counted within: R019 (16 non-submitters at the 05/19 IOI deadline \\u2014 recommended reading: no Party A bid is reported and its last named activity precedes the IOI solicitation), R020 (two excluded low bidders) or R033/R034 (the two non-submitting LOI bidders). Count 0 \\u2014 no new bidder unit; no cohort count is moved to a name.',\n    why='Inferred: identity. Premises: Party A is last named in April 2016 (P-009, p.28, memorandum recipients) and never again; the first identified continuing set that excludes it is ' + q(570, 'G&W and Party B') + ' (P-023, p.30). The filing does not identify which anonymous exit was Party A\\u2019s own.',\n    src='P-006; P-009; P-023', link='P-023', review='Q3; Q5', count=0, dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,27),\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: decision day', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: identity',\n    page=30, related='R019; R020; R033; R034', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 43-44. Re-entries\nfor rid, nm, typ, old in [('R043','Party D','Financial','R039'), ('R044','Party E','Strategic','R040')]:\n    add(rid=rid, n=43+['R043','R044'].index(rid), when='07/29/2016', who=nm, what='Re-entered', proc=1, rnd='3', typ=typ,\n        terms='GHF calls; ' + nm.split()[1] + ' expressed interest in reengaging and enhancing its offer \\u2014 renewed participation after the 07/27/2016 drop (see ' + old + '); revised LOI followed on 08/01/2016.',\n        why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'On July 29, 2016, representatives of GHF had calls with Party D and Party E. During those calls, Party D and Party E both expressed interest in reengaging and enhancing their offers.') + ' (P-024, p.30).',\n        src='P-024', link='P-024', review='Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,29), dto=D(2016,7,29), wdate=D(2016,7,29),\n        dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=30, related=old + '; R045/R046'.replace('R045/R046','R045' if old=='R039' else 'R046'), deal=DEAL)\n\n# 45. Party D revised LOI\nadd(rid='R045', n=45, when='08/01/2016', who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Financial',\n    terms='Revised LOI: $24.00 per share, with a 30-day due diligence period; D also requested that the Company commit not to sign with another bidder during that period (request reported and declined on 08/02, R048). Formal documentation carried from its July mark-ups.',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'On August 1, 2016, Party D submitted a revised LOI at a price of $24.00 per share and Party E submitted a revised LOI, along with financing support, from Party F, at a price of $23.81 per share. Both revised proposals contained a 30-day due diligence period.') + ' (P-024, p.30). Formal carried (July mark-ups, P-015, p.29); Heavy (30-day diligence); exclusivity-like no-sign request: ' + q(571, 'Party D declined to shorten its due diligence period and requested that the Company commit that it would not enter into an agreement with another bidder during its 30-day due diligence period.') + ' (P-024, p.30).',\n    src='P-015; P-024', link='P-024', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,1), dto=D(2016,8,1), wdate=D(2016,8,1),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=24.00, phigh=24.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (30 days)', page=30,\n    related='revises R030; R043; R048', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 46. Party E revised LOI with F support\nadd(rid='R046', n=46, when='08/01/2016', who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Support: Party F (financing) \\u2014 revised LOI at $23.81 per share with a 30-day due diligence period, submitted along with financing support from Party F. Related rows point to Party F\\u2019s earlier independent bid (R032); F had already exited on 07/27/2016 (R041), so it gets no new row and no Re-entered (support is not a bidding-group change).',\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'Party E submitted a revised LOI, along with financing support, from Party F, at a price of $23.81 per share. Both revised proposals contained a 30-day due diligence period.') + ' (P-024, p.30). Formality Informal (E\\u2019s issues summary only; no mark-up reported for E). Conditions Heavy (30-day diligence); financing support represented but commitment level not stated.',\n    src='P-024; P-032', link='P-024', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,1), dto=D(2016,8,1), wdate=D(2016,8,1),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=23.81, phigh=23.81, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: represented; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\n    related='revises R029; R032 (Party F prior bid); R044; R047', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 47. Party E reversion\nadd(rid='R047', n=47, when='08/02/2016', who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Bid reversion \\u2014 withdrew its revised $23.81 proposal and confirmed its original $21.26 per-share proposal (with its 60-day exclusivity condition). A withdrawal of the higher proposal while confirming the older one is a reversion, not a process withdrawal.',\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'Party E withdrew its revised proposal on August 2, 2016 (but confirmed its original proposal of $21.26 per share)') + ' (P-024, p.30). Convention: price carried forward from R029 (not restated); conditions reassessed from the confirmed original (60-day exclusive diligence/negotiation period).',\n    src='P-024; P-018', link='P-024', review='Q6', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,8,2), dto=D(2016,8,2), wdate=D(2016,8,2),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=21.26, phigh=21.26, pkind='Point', porigin='Carried forward', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (60 days); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (60 days)', page=30,\n    related='withdraws R046; reverts to R029; closed by R055', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 48. Party D paused\nadd(rid='R048', n=48, when='08/02/2016', who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Participation paused', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Financial',\n    terms='D declined to shorten its 30-day diligence period and requested that the Company commit not to sign with another bidder during it; the Company declined (given the active interest of Party B and G&W); D then indicated it would not proceed with further due diligence \\u201cat that time\\u201d. Treated as the bidder\\u2019s own stated temporary stop (a pause is not an exit); closed at signing (R054).',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'Party D declined to shorten its due diligence period and requested that the Company commit that it would not enter into an agreement with another bidder during its 30-day due diligence period. In light of the active interest of Party B and G&W, the Company declined to make such a commitment, at which point Party D indicated that it would not proceed with further due diligence at that time.') + ' (P-024, p.30).',\n    src='P-024', link='P-024', review='Q5; Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,2), dto=D(2016,8,2), wdate=D(2016,8,2),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', decidedby='Bidder', exitreason='Terms or process', obasis='Stated', page=30,\n    related='see R045; closed by R054', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 49. Aug 4 TC decision\nadd(rid='R049', n=49, when='08/04/2016', who='Transaction Committee', what='Target decision', proc=1, rnd='3',\n    terms='Preferred-bidder decision: continue diligence and negotiations with both G&W and Party B, but given Party B\\u2019s higher price, prioritize Party B and complete the merger-agreement negotiation with Party B. Contemporaneous on-site diligence by both bidders ran 07/27\\u201308/11/2016.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(573, 'the Transaction Committee directed the management team and representatives of each of BMO and Hinckley Allen to continue diligence and negotiations with both G&W and Party B, but given the higher price offered by Party B, to prioritize Party B and proceed to complete the negotiation of the merger agreement with Party B.') + ' (P-026, p.31).',\n    src='P-026', link='P-026', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,8,4), dto=D(2016,8,4), wdate=D(2016,8,4),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=31, related='R050; R051', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 50. Party B late reconfirmation\nadd(rid='R050', n=50, when='08/04/2016', who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Bid reaffirmed', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Reaffirmed by: returned draft \\u2014 Party B\\u2019s legal counsel provided a revised merger agreement draft; $24.00 carried forward (not restated). Flagged for review (late reconfirmation).',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Light',\n    why='Late reconfirmation per the three-part test. (a) Target moved to finalize with B: ' + q(573, 'to prioritize Party B and proceed to complete the negotiation of the merger agreement with Party B') + ' (P-026, p.31). (b) B\\u2019s latest priced row (R028) sits in Round 2 (Not final). (c) Bidder-side act: ' + q(574, 'On August 4, 2016, legal counsel for Party B provided a revised draft of the merger agreement') + ' (P-027, p.31). $24.00 carried forward; Formal (returned draft, signal 1); Light (only an expedited diligence review attached); DD open: yes (on-site diligence ran 07/27\\u201308/11, P-026, p.31).',\n    src='P-026; P-027; P-016', link='P-027', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,4), dto=D(2016,8,4), wdate=D(2016,8,4),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=24.00, phigh=24.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Carried forward', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: confirmatory; DD open: yes; Excl: none', page=31,\n    related='reaffirms R028; R049; superseded by R053', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 51. Aug 9 G&W warning\nadd(rid='R051', n=51, when='08/09/2016', who='Transaction Committee / BMO; G&W', what='Material process update', proc=1, rnd='3',\n    terms='Committee directed BMO to inform G&W that the Company intended to enter a merger agreement with another bidder; G&W requested to continue its due diligence (including physical diligence on 08/10 and 08/11) to potentially facilitate an improved offer, which was granted. Consequential for the outcome: G&W then improved to $25.00 (R052).',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(574, 'the Transaction Committee directed representatives of BMO to inform G&W that the Company intended to enter into a merger agreement with another bidder. G&W requested that it be allowed to continue its due diligence, including physical due diligence on August 10 and August 11, 2016, to potentially facilitate an improved offer, which request was granted.') + ' (P-027, p.31).',\n    src='P-027', link='P-027', dfrom=D(2016,8,9), dto=D(2016,8,9), wdate=D(2016,8,9),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=31, related='R052', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 52. G&W final bid\nadd(rid='R052', n=52, when='08/12/2016', who='G&W (Genesee & Wyoming Inc.)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Revised LOI: $25.00 per share in cash; previously proposed CVR excluded; mark-ups of the merger agreement and voting agreement; offer to expire at 6:00 p.m. on the following day (08/13/2016). Submitted after BMO told G&W the Company intended to sign with another bidder (R051).',\n    formality='Formal', cond='Light',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(575, 'G&W submitted a revised LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $25.00 per share in cash, which excluded the previously proposed CVR, together with mark-ups of the merger agreement and the voting agreement. G&W\\u2019s LOI further indicated that the offer would expire at 6:00 p.m. on the following day.') + ' (P-028, p.31). Formality Formal (returned mark-ups and price set during definitive negotiation); conditions Light (no diligence condition attached; physical diligence completed 08/11, P-027, p.31; priced all in cash).',\n    src='P-027; P-028', link='P-028', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,12), dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=25.00, phigh=25.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\n    allcash='Yes', cashclose=25.00, conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: none; DD open: no; Excl: none', page=31,\n    related='revises R036; supersedes R050/R035; closed by R056', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 53. Party B not selected\nadd(rid='R053', n=53, when='08/12/2016', who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Not selected at signing', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Still bidding when the Board chose G&W: at the Board\\u2019s request BMO asked Party B whether it would increase its price and Party B declined. Exit reason: Would not improve earlier offer (asked to improve and declined); agency remains with the target\\u2019s selection.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(579, 'At the request of the Board, representatives of BMO then contacted Party B to determine if it would increase its offer price. Party B indicated that it would not increase its price.') + ' ... ' + q(579, 'The Board determined that the G&W offer represented the superior proposal.') + ' (P-032, p.32).',\n    src='P-032', link='P-032', review='Q5', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,12), dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Would not improve earlier offer', obasis='Stated',\n    page=32, related='R050; R056', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 54-55. Inferred closes at signing\nadd(rid='R054', n=54, when='By 08/12/2016', who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Not selected at signing', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Financial',\n    terms='Inferred: silent \\u2014 last reported activity was D\\u2019s 08/02/2016 pause (R048); the filing never mentions D again; closed at signing as a bidder still live in the process. No notice to D is reported; no invented motive or exit.',\n    why='Inferred: silent. Last appearance: ' + q(571, 'Party D indicated that it would not proceed with further due diligence at that time') + ' (P-024, p.30); the next identified transition is the 08/12/2016 signing (P-033, p.32), with only G&W named as acquirer. Closing convention (section 10.2).',\n    src='P-024; P-033', link='P-033', review='Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: bound', decidedby='Unknown', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: silent',\n    page=32, related='R048; R056', deal=DEAL)\nadd(rid='R055', n=55, when='By 08/12/2016', who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Not selected at signing', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Inferred: silent \\u2014 last reported activity was E\\u2019s 08/02/2016 reversion to its $21.26 proposal (R047); the filing never mentions E again; closed at signing as a bidder still live in the process. No notice to E is reported.',\n    why='Inferred: silent. Last appearance: ' + q(571, 'Party E withdrew its revised proposal on August 2, 2016 (but confirmed its original proposal of $21.26 per share)') + ' (P-024, p.30); the next identified transition is the 08/12/2016 signing (P-033, p.32), with only G&W named as acquirer. Closing convention (section 10.2).',\n    src='P-024; P-033', link='P-033', review='Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: bound', decidedby='Unknown', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: silent',\n    page=32, related='R047; R056', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 56. Signing\nadd(rid='R056', n=56, when='08/12/2016', who='Company and G&W (Pullman Acquisition Sub Inc.)', what='Merger agreement signed', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Agreed consideration: $25.00 in cash per share of common stock; each preferred share deemed converted (100-for-1) into 100 common shares plus accrued/unpaid dividends (X-008, p.50); Merger Sub merges into the Company (surviving as a G&W subsidiary); Eder Trusts voting agreement executed (482,742? no\\u2014842,742 common / 500 preferred; X-013, p.72); termination fee $3,785,000 (~3% of transaction value; G&W\\u2019s draft reduced from 3.85%) (X-010, p.55); outside date 12/31/2016, or 02/28/2017 if only STB approval remains (X-016, p.8); no go-shop \\u2014 non-solicitation with fiduciary out and matching rights. Board approved (Director Smith recused) after BMO\\u2019s oral fairness opinion, confirmed in writing 08/12/2016 (P-032, p.32). Signing is not a new bid: price/formality cells left blank.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(580, 'Shortly thereafter, Hinckley Allen and Simpson Thacher finalized the transaction documents and the Company and G&W executed the merger agreement, and the Company, G&W and the Eder Trusts executed the voting agreement.') + ' (P-033, p.32). Consideration and terms per X-008; X-010; X-013; X-016.',\n    src='P-032; P-033; X-008; X-010; X-013; X-016', link='P-033', review='Q8', dfrom=D(2016,8,12), dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=32, related='R052; R053; R057', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 57. Announcement\nadd(rid='R057', n=57, when='08/15/2016', who='Company (issuer) / G&W', what='Merger announced', proc=1, rnd='post', typ='Strategic',\n    terms='Press release publicly announced the transaction before the opening of NASDAQ trading on Monday, 08/15/2016.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(580, 'The Company issued a press release publicly announcing the transaction on Monday, August 15, 2016 prior to the opening of trading of the Company\\u2019s common stock on the NASDAQ.') + ' (P-033, p.32).',\n    src='P-033', link='P-033', count=None, dfrom=D(2016,8,15), dto=D(2016,8,15), wdate=D(2016,8,15),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=32, related='R056', deal=DEAL)\n\n# 58. BMO conflict update\nadd(rid='R058', n=58, when='09/06/2016', who='Board of Directors / BMO Capital Markets Corp.', what='Material process update', proc=1, rnd='post',\n    terms='Post-signing: the Board considered BMO\\u2019s report that it had inadvertently failed to identify a BMO affiliate\\u2019s participation in G&W\\u2019s existing secured syndicated debt facility (approximately 5% of the syndicate; revenue of $1\\u2013$5 million since 01/01/2014; X-006/X-007, p.41\\u201342); the Board determined the relationship was not material to BMO\\u2019s independence and confirmed continued comfort with BMO\\u2019s engagement and opinion.',\n    why='Stated. ' + q(581, 'representatives of BMO advised the Board that when checking to determine if there were any financial advisory or financing relationships with G&W, it had inadvertently failed to identify that a BMO affiliate has a participation in G&W\\u2019s existing secured syndicated debt facility') + ' ... ' + q(581, 'On September 6, 2016, the Board considered this new information, determined this relationship was not material to BMO\\u2019s independence and confirmed that the Board remained comfortable with the engagement and opinion of BMO.') + ' (P-034, p.32); facility detail X-007, p.42.',\n    src='P-034; X-006; X-007', link='P-034', dfrom=D(2016,9,6), dto=D(2016,9,6), wdate=D(2016,9,6),\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=32, related='R002; R056', deal=DEAL)\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# BUILD WORKBOOK\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nwb = Workbook()\n\nVISIBLE = ['Deal ledger','Summary','Questions','Source text']\nws_led = wb.active; ws_led.title = 'Deal ledger'\nws_sum = wb.create_sheet('Summary')\nws_que = wb.create_sheet('Questions')\nws_src = wb.create_sheet('Source text')\nws_orig = wb.create_sheet('AI original')\nws_lists = wb.create_sheet('Lists')\nws_orig.sheet_state = 'hidden'\nws_lists.sheet_state = 'hidden'\n\nHDR_FILL = PatternFill('solid', fgColor='1F3864')\nHDR_FONT = Font(bold=True, color='FFFFFF', size=9)\nGRP_FILL = PatternFill('solid', fgColor='D9E1F2')\nBOLD = Font(bold=True)\nWRAP = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top')\nWRAP_C = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top', horizontal='center')\n\nLEDGER_HEADERS = ['#','When','Who','What happened','Process','Round','Type','Terms or outcome','Formality',\n 'Conditions level','Why and evidence','Source','Review','Reviewer note']\nEXP_HEADERS = ['Row id','Include','Count','Date from','Date to','Working date','Date basis','Date method',\n 'Price low','Price high','Price kind','Price origin','Currency','All cash','Cash at closing','Conditions detail',\n 'Due date','Deadline treatment','Round finality','Decided by','Exit reason','Outcome basis','Page','Related rows','Deal']\nALL_HEADERS = LEDGER_HEADERS + EXP_HEADERS\nNCOL = len(ALL_HEADERS)\n\ndef write_header(ws, headers, row=1):\n    for c, h in enumerate(headers, start=1):\n        cell = ws.cell(row=row, column=c, value=h)\n        cell.fill = HDR_FILL; cell.font = HDR_FONT\n        cell.alignment = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='center', horizontal='center')\n    ws.row_dimensions[row].height = 30\n\nwrite_header(ws_led, ALL_HEADERS)\n\ndef put(ws, r, c, v, fmt=None):\n    cell = ws.cell(row=r, column=c, value=v)\n    cell.alignment = WRAP\n    if fmt: cell.number_format = fmt\n    return cell\n\nFIELD_ORDER = ['n','when','who','what','proc','rnd','typ','terms','formality','cond','why','src','review','reviewer','rid','include','count','dfrom','dto','wdate','dbasis','dmethod','plow','phigh','pkind','porigin','ccy','allcash','cashclose','conddetail','duedate','dtreat','rfinal','decidedby','exitreason','obasis','page','related','deal']\n\n# source ids -> source sheet row number (will be set after writing source sheet; compute now: header at row 1, P rows start 2)\nSRC_ROW = {}\nfor i, (pid, sec, p, t) in enumerate(P_ROWS):\n    SRC_ROW[pid] = 2 + i\nfor i, (pid, sec, p, t) in enumerate(X_ROWS):\n    SRC_ROW[pid] = 2 + len(P_ROWS) + i\n\nLEDGER_LAST = 1 + len(ROWS)\nfor r, row in enumerate(ROWS, start=2):\n    row.setdefault('include', 'Yes')\n    for c, f in enumerate(FIELD_ORDER, start=1):\n        v = row.get(f)\n        if f in ('dfrom','dto','wdate','duedate') and v is not None:\n            cell = put(ws_led, r, c, v, 'mm/dd/yyyy')\n        elif f in ('plow','phigh','cashclose') and v is not None:\n            cell = put(ws_led, r, c, v, '#,##0.00')\n        else:\n            cell = put(ws_led, r, c, v)\n    # hyperlink on Source column (col 12)\n    scell = ws_led.cell(row=r, column=12)\n    main = row['link']\n    scell.value = row['src']\n    scell.hyperlink = Hyperlink(ref=scell.coordinate, location=f\"'Source text'!$A${SRC_ROW[main]}\", tooltip='main source paragraph')\n    scell.font = Font(color='0563C1', underline='single')\n    ws_led.row_dimensions[r].height = 88\n\n# widths\nLEDGER_W = {'A':5,'B':20,'C':24,'D':17,'E':8,'F':7,'G':11,'H':52,'I':12,'J':11,'K':62,'L':22,'M':10,'N':12,\n 'O':8,'P':8,'Q':7,'R':11,'S':11,'T':12,'U':14,'V':16,'W':9,'X':10,'Y':14,'Z':14,'AA':9,'AB':10,'AC':12,'AD':34,\n 'AE':11,'AF':16,'AG':14,'AH':11,'AI':20,'AJ':16,'AK':6,'AL':26,'AM':10}\nfor col, w in LEDGER_W.items():\n    ws_led.column_dimensions[col].width = w\n\nws_led.freeze_panes = 'D2'\nws_led.auto_filter.ref = f'A1:{get_column_letter(NCOL)}{LEDGER_LAST}'\nws_led.sheet_view.zoomScale = 90\n\n# collapsed expandable groups (Row id+Include; Count; dates; prices; cash; conditions; deadlines; outcomes; page; related; deal)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('O','P', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('Q', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('R','V', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('W','AA', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AB','AC', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AD', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AE','AG', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AH','AJ', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AK', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AL', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AM', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\nws_led.sheet_properties.outlinePr.summaryRight = False\nws_led.sheet_properties.outlinePr.summaryBelow = True\n\n# ---- AI original (values copy of the ledger) ----\nfor r in range(1, LEDGER_LAST+1):\n    for c in range(1, NCOL+1):\n        v = ws_led.cell(row=r, column=c).value\n        ws_orig.cell(row=r, column=c, value=v)\nfor col, w in LEDGER_W.items():\n    ws_orig.column_dimensions[col].width = w\nws_orig.freeze_panes = 'D2'\n\n# ---- Lists + data validation ----\nLISTS = {\n 'What happened': ['Target interest','Bidder interest','Target sale decision','Activist pressure','Activist involvement',\n   'Adviser engaged','Adviser service observed','Adviser ended','Contact','NDA signed','Round opened','Deadline set',\n   'Deadline revised','Deadline','Target decision','Information access changed','Material process update',\n   'Exclusivity changed','Bid','Bid reaffirmed','Offer update','Other-scope bid','Valuation statement',\n   'Bidding group changed','Joined group','Dropped by target','Withdrew','Did not submit','Participation paused',\n   'Re-entered','Not selected at signing','Sale process announced','Bid announced','Merger announced',\n   'Merger agreement signed','Go-shop changed','Process terminated','Process restarted','Agreement terminated','Closed'],\n 'Type': ['Strategic','Financial','Mixed','Unknown'],\n 'Formality': ['Formal','Informal','Insufficient evidence','Varies'],\n 'Conditions level': ['None','Light','Heavy','Insufficient evidence','Varies'],\n 'Include': ['Yes','No'],\n 'Date basis': ['Reported day','Inferred day','Reported interval','Approximate window','Relative only','Undated'],\n 'Date method': ['Reported','Inferred','Assigned: deadline','Assigned: decision day','Assigned: midpoint','Assigned: bound','Assigned: sequence'],\n 'Price kind': ['Point','Bidder range','Group envelope','Bound only','Undisclosed'],\n 'Price origin': ['Stated','Carried forward','Inferred'],\n 'All cash': ['Yes','No','Not stated'],\n 'Deadline treatment': ['Enforced','Extended','Late bids accepted','Passed without action','Unclear','No deadline stated'],\n 'Round finality': ['Announced as final','Inferred final','Not final'],\n 'Decided by': ['Bidder','Target','Both','Unknown'],\n 'Exit reason': ['Value below market price','Value at or below market price','Value below earlier offer','Value at earlier offer',\n   'Would not improve earlier offer','Lower offer than rivals','Terms or process','Other stated reason','Not stated'],\n 'Outcome basis': ['Stated','Inferred: residual','Inferred: exclusivity','Inferred: silent','Inferred: identity'],\n}\nws_lists.cell(row=1, column=1, value='List')\nfor j, (name, vals) in enumerate(LISTS.items(), start=1):\n    col = get_column_letter(j)\n    ws_lists.cell(row=1, column=j, value=name).font = BOLD\n    for i, v in enumerate(vals, start=2):\n        ws_lists.cell(row=i, column=j, value=v)\n    ws_lists.column_dimensions[col].width = max(12, len(name)+2)\n\nVALID = [('D', 'What happened'), ('G','Type'), ('I','Formality'), ('J','Conditions level'), ('P','Include'),\n         ('U','Date basis'), ('V','Date method'), ('Y','Price kind'), ('Z','Price origin'), ('AB','All cash'),\n         ('AF','Deadline treatment'), ('AG','Round finality'), ('AH','Decided by'), ('AI','Exit reason'), ('AJ','Outcome basis')]\nlist_col = {name: get_column_letter(j) for j, name in enumerate(LISTS, start=1)}\nfor col, name in VALID:\n    dv = DataValidation(type='list', formula1=f'Lists!${list_col[name]}$2:${list_col[name]}${len(LISTS[name])+1}',\n                        allow_blank=True, showDropDown=False)\n    dv.error = 'Use a value from the Lists sheet'; dv.errorTitle = 'Controlled category'\n    ws_led.add_data_validation(dv)\n    dv.add(f'{col}2:{col}{LEDGER_LAST}')\n\n# conditional highlight: changed vs AI original (red bold) and new rows\ncf_range = f'B2:{get_column_letter(NCOL)}{LEDGER_LAST}'\nchanged_formula = (f\"AND($A2<>\\\"\\\",NOT(ISNA(MATCH($A2,'AI original'!$A$2:$A${LEDGER_LAST},0))),\"\n                   f\"NOT(EXACT(B2&\\\"\\\",INDEX('AI original'!$B$2:${get_column_letter(NCOL)}${LEDGER_LAST},\"\n                   f\"MATCH($A2,'AI original'!$A$2:$A${LEDGER_LAST},0),COLUMN()-1)&\\\"\\\")))\")\nnew_formula = f\"AND($A2<>\\\"\\\",ISNA(MATCH($A2,'AI original'!$A$2:$A${LEDGER_LAST},0)))\"\nws_led.conditional_formatting.add(cf_range, FormulaRule(formula=[changed_formula], font=Font(bold=True, color='C00000'), stopIfTrue=False))\nws_led.conditional_formatting.add(cf_range, FormulaRule(formula=[new_formula], font=Font(bold=True, color='C00000'), stopIfTrue=False))\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# SOURCE TEXT SHEET\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nwrite_header(ws_src, ['Paragraph','Section','Page','Text'])\nsr = 2\nfor pid, sec, p, t in P_ROWS + X_ROWS:\n    put(ws_src, sr, 1, pid); put(ws_src, sr, 2, sec)\n    pc = put(ws_src, sr, 3, int(p) if p else None); pc.alignment = WRAP_C\n    put(ws_src, sr, 4, t)\n    sr += 1\nws_src.column_dimensions['A'].width = 11\nws_src.column_dimensions['B'].width = 48\nws_src.column_dimensions['C'].width = 7\nws_src.column_dimensions['D'].width = 140\nws_src.freeze_panes = 'A2'\nws_src.auto_filter.ref = f'A1:D{sr-1}'\nfor r in range(2, sr):\n    ws_src.row_dimensions[r].height = 60\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# SUMMARY SHEET\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\ndef S(row, a='', b='', bold_a=False, bold_b=False, wrap=True):\n    ca = ws_sum.cell(row=row, column=1, value=a); ca.alignment = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top')\n    cb = ws_sum.cell(row=row, column=2, value=b); cb.alignment = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top')\n    if bold_a: ca.font = BOLD\n    if bold_b: cb.font = BOLD\n    return row+1\n\nr = 1\nr = S(r, 'PWRR / GENESEE & WYOMING DEAL LEDGER \\u2014 SUMMARY', '', bold_a=True)\nr = S(r, 'AI first pass; not human-approved.', 'Instruction revision: 19 September 2026 (Pro revision of 18 September 2026). Supplied-source coverage: one SEC filing used \\u2014 DEFM14A (definitive proxy statement), proxy dated September 19, 2016, filed 2016-09-20, file raw_filing/providence-worcester_2016-09-20_DEFM14A.htm (background pp.27\\u201332). No other source used. Last recheck status: initial build; all checks in this workbook were run on this version (see Questions \\u2013 Check results); content not yet rechecked after any human edit.')\nr += 1\nr = S(r, '1. STATUS AND COMMERCIAL ACCOUNT', '', bold_a=True)\nr = S(r, 'Commercial account', 'Party A\\u2019s fourth-quarter 2015 expression of interest in acquiring equity in Providence & Worcester Railroad prompted the Board to engage GHF and, on 03/14/2016, to authorize a broad solicitation of strategic and financial buyers (29 contacted in the week of 03/28/2016; 25 executed confidentiality agreements, plus Party C in July). Nine non-binding IOIs ($17.93\\u2013$26.50 per share) arrived 05/19\\u201306/01/2016; the two lowest were excluded and seven bidders advanced on 06/01/2016 to management presentations and a 07/20/2016 LOI round (six LOIs, $19.20\\u2013$24.00). On 07/27/2016 the committee selected G&W and Party B for confirmatory diligence and definitive negotiation. G&W\\u2019s July bids carried a $1.13/share CVR tied to the South Quay property and asked for a three-week exclusive diligence period; its 07/26 revision raised the price to $22.15, while Party B led at $24.00. After Party B declined to improve on 08/12/2016, G&W submitted a final $25.00 all-cash revised LOI (CVR dropped) with merger-agreement mark-ups and an offer expiry of 6:00 p.m. on 08/13/2016; the Board approved and the parties signed the merger agreement the same day, announcing it on 08/15/2016. Observed outcome: signed merger agreement; no post-signing competing proposal appears in the proxy; closing is not observed (expected Q4 2016).')\nr = S(r, 'Initiation assessment', 'Mixed \\u2014 bidder-led trigger (Party A\\u2019s Q4 2015 unpriced approach) followed by a target-directed broad sale process led by the Board and Transaction Committee. Sequence and evidence: R001\\u2013R006.')\nr += 1\nr = S(r, '2. DEAL FACTS', '', bold_a=True)\nr = S(r, 'Target', 'Providence and Worcester Railroad Company (PWRR), a Rhode Island corporation; regional freight railroad; NASDAQ: PWX. 4,866,593 common shares and 640 preferred shares outstanding as of the 09/16/2016 record date; preferred is non-listed and converts 100-for-1.')\nr = S(r, 'Focal acquirer and type', 'Genesee & Wyoming Inc. (G&W), a Delaware corporation, NYSE: GWR \\u2014 Strategic (operating short-line/regional freight railroad group; X-014, p.21). Acquired through Pullman Acquisition Sub Inc., formed 08/12/2016 solely for the merger (P-002 area; R056).')\nr = S(r, 'Agreed consideration', '$25.00 in cash per share of common stock. Each preferred share is deemed converted (100-for-1) into 100 common shares plus accrued/unpaid dividends, so its holder receives $25.00 per converted share (X-008, p.50). No financing condition (X-003, p.34); termination fee $3,785,000 (~3% of transaction value); non-solicitation with a fiduciary out; no go-shop (X-010, p.55).')\nr = S(r, 'Signing / announcement / completion', 'Signed 08/12/2016; announced 08/15/2016 before the NASDAQ open (R056, R057); expected closing Q4 2016, not observed; outside date 12/31/2016 (02/28/2017 if only STB approval remains) (X-016, p.8).')\nr = S(r, 'Filing', 'DEFM14A proxy statement dated September 19, 2016 (filed 2016-09-20 per filename); source file: raw_filing/providence-worcester_2016-09-20_DEFM14A.htm; background pp.27\\u201332.')\nr = S(r, 'Market benchmarks', 'Closing price $16.30 on 08/12/2016 (last trading day before announcement; the $25.00 consideration represents a 53% premium per the Reasons section) and $24.88 on 09/16/2016 (X-004, p.11; X-002, p.33). Q3 2016 trading high $25.00 (p.71).')\nr += 1\nr = S(r, '3. PROCESS AND ROUND MAP', '', bold_a=True)\nr = S(r, 'Process count', 'One process (Process 1). The sale attempt ran continuously from Party A\\u2019s Q4 2015 approach through signing on 08/12/2016; no abandonment, dormancy or restart is reported, so no second process. Round 0 holds the pre-opening inbound approach and preparation.')\nr = S(r, 'Round 0 (pre-opening)', 'Q4 2015\\u201303/27/2016: Party A approach (R001); GHF engagement (R002); Board sale decision (R003); Party A management meeting (R004); Transaction Committee authorization (R005). No Round opened row for round 0 by convention.')\nr = S(r, 'Round 1', 'Anchor: first outreach wave, week of 03/28/2016 (R006) \\u2014 GHF contacted 11 potential strategic buyers and 18 potential financial buyers; IOI deadline set 04/27/2016 for 05/10/2016, revised to 05/19/2016 (R015\\u2013R017). Nine IOIs ($17.93\\u2013$26.50 envelope) received 05/19\\u201306/01 (R018). Objective: non-binding IOIs. Finality: Not final. Round-bidder tally: 9 (formula in section 5).')\nr = S(r, 'Round 2', 'Opened 06/01/2016 (R021): seven of nine IOI bidders advanced to management presentations and data-site diligence; Party C entered as a late entrant (R023\\u2013R026); all buyers instructed mid-June to submit LOIs plus mark-ups by 07/20/2016 (R022, R027); six LOIs received late July (R028\\u2013R036). Objective: presentations/diligence then non-binding LOIs. Finality: Not final. Round-bidder tally: 6 (B, G&W, C, D, E, F).')\nr = S(r, 'Round 3', 'Opened 07/27/2016 (R037): selection of G&W and Party B for confirmatory diligence and definitive negotiation; remaining bidders dropped (R038\\u2013R041); D and E re-entered 07/29 (R043\\u2013R044) and revised their LOIs 08/01 with outcomes 08/02 (R045\\u2013R048); Aug 4 prioritization of Party B (R049) and Party B\\u2019s late reconfirmation (R050); G&W warning and improved bid (R051\\u2013R052); signing 08/12 (R056). Finality: Inferred final (moved to definitive negotiation with selected bidders). Round-bidder tally: 4 (G&W, B, D, E).')\nr = S(r, 'Post-signing', '08/12/2016 onward: announcement 08/15 (R057); BMO conflict recheck 09/06 (R058); STB petition filed 09/01/2016 and voting-trust agreement submitted 09/14/2016 (X-011/X-012, p.64\\u201365). No go-shop; no post-signing competing proposal observed in the proxy; closing not observed.')\nr = S(r, 'Deadline map', '05/10/2016 (set 04/27/2016): Extended \\u2014 postponed to 05/19/2016 (R015\\u2013R016). 05/19/2016 (IOI due): Enforced \\u2014 nine IOIs reviewed and process advanced 06/01; the 05/19\\u201306/01 receipt window straddles the date and no arrival is dated after it (R017; alternative reading in Q2). 07/20/2016 (LOI/mark-up due): Late bids accepted \\u2014 G&W\\u2019s 07/21 LOI was reviewed with the others and advanced (R027).')\nr += 1\nr = S(r, '4. PARTICIPANTS AND ADVISERS', '', bold_a=True)\nr = S(r, 'Named bidders', 'Party A \\u2014 Strategic (Class I rail partner); unpriced Q4 2015 approach; last named April 2016; closed by Count-0 identity row R042 (Inferred: identity). G&W \\u2014 Strategic; winner; bids R035, R036, R052; signed R056 (no exit row). Party B \\u2014 Strategic; $24.00 LOI R028 and late reaffirmation R050; Not selected at signing R053 (Would not improve earlier offer). Party C \\u2014 Strategic late entrant; IOI $21.00 R025, LOI $19.30 R031; Dropped R038. Party D \\u2014 Financial; LOI $21.00 R030, revised $24.00 R045; paused R048; closed by inferred R054. Party E \\u2014 Strategic; LOI $21.26 R029, revised $23.81 with Party F support R046, reverted to $21.26 R047; closed by inferred R055. Party F \\u2014 Strategic; LOI $19.20 R032; Dropped R041; later gave financing support to E (no membership change).')\nr = S(r, 'Cohorts (not extra parties)', '11 strategic NDA signers (R009); 14 financial NDA signers (R010); nine IOI bidders, type Unknown (R018); two excluded low bidders, Unknown (R020); 16 non-submitting signers, Unknown (R019); two non-submitting LOI bidders, split strategic/financial (R033\\u2013R034). Two additional Class I railroads were contacted but never entered (R013).')\nr = S(r, 'Ownership / country attributes', 'PWRR is US (Rhode Island); G&W is US (Delaware). Eder Trusts hold 842,742 common shares (17.3%) and 500 preferred (78.1%); directors/officers hold ~22.7% of common and ~78.1% of preferred (X-013, p.72). Director Alfred P. Smith (GATX VP; GATX owns 4.92% of common) recused from the process (P-023, p.30).')\nr = S(r, 'Advisers', 'GHF / BMO Capital Markets Corp. \\u2014 Company financial adviser; GHF engaged 01/27/2016 (R002); BMO acquired GHF\\u2019s business 08/01/2016 (one continuing relationship); fee ~$2.52 million; BMO affiliate ~5% lender in G&W\\u2019s syndicated facility, reviewed 09/06/2016 (R058). Hinckley, Allen & Snyder LLP \\u2014 Company legal counsel (first observed 03/24/2016, R005). Simpson Thacher & Bartlett LLP \\u2014 G&W legal counsel (first observed 08/10/2016, P-027). Company STB counsel \\u2014 not named. G&W financial adviser \\u2014 not disclosed.')\nr += 1\nr = S(r, '5. COUNTS AND AUCTION SCREEN', '', bold_a=True)\ndef fcount(row_label, note, formula):\n    global r\n    r = S(r, row_label, note)\n    c = ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value=formula); c.alignment = Alignment(vertical='top')\nr = S(r, 'Contact tally (ledger formula)', '=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Contact\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\") \\u2014 33 contact-count units: 29 initial wave (R007+R008) + 2 additional Class I railroads (R013) + Party A first contact (R001) + Party C inbound (R023). Party B\\u2019s contact (R014) carries no Count because its membership in the wave cohort is not disclosed. Distinct prospective buyers contacted: 32 (Party A is counted once inside the 29 and again only as the earlier first contact).')\nr = S(r, 'NDA tally (ledger formula)', '=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"NDA signed\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\") \\u2014 26 signer events: 11 strategic (R009) + 14 financial (R010) + Party C (R024). Filing assertion: the Reasons section states 25 confidentiality agreements (X-001, p.33). Reconciliation: the narrative\\u2019s 11 + 14 = 25 is the March\\u2013April wave; Party C executed its agreement in early July after approaching the Company (R023\\u2013R024). 26 \\u2212 25 = 1 = Party C; unresolved whether the Reasons\\u2019 25 includes or excludes Party C (Q3).')\nr = S(r, 'Round-bidder tallies (formulas)', 'Round 1: =SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$F:$F,\"1\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\") = 9 (R018 envelope cohort). Round 2: same with Round \"2\" plus \"Bid reaffirmed\" = 6 (B R028, E R029, D R030, C R025 at Count 1, F R032, G&W R035). Round 3: Round \"3\" bids plus reaffirmation = 4 (D R045, E R046, B R050, G&W R052). These are stage-specific submitters, not unique firms.')\nr = S(r, 'Per-stage balance', 'Round 1: 25 signers \\u2212 16 inferred non-submitters (R019) \\u2212 2 stated exclusions (R020) = 7 continuing (R021). Round 2: 7 continuing + 1 late entrant (Party C) = 8; \\u2212 2 stated non-submitters (R033\\u2013R034) \\u2212 4 stated drops (R038\\u2013R041) = 2 continuing (R037). Round 3: 2 + 2 re-entries (R043\\u2013R044) \\u2212 3 closures (R053\\u2013R055) = 1 winner (G&W). Inferred share of exits: 16 of 25 inferred (64%) in Round 1; 2 of 3 R3 closures inferred silent; no inferred identity was converted into a count (R042 Count 0).')\nr = S(r, 'Outcome tallies (occurrences/units)', 'Dropped by target: 2 units (R020) + 4 units (R038\\u2013R041) + 1 Count-0 identity row (R042). Did not submit: 16 units (R019) + 2 units (R033\\u2013R034). Participation paused: 1 (R048). Re-entered: 2 (R043\\u2013R044). Not selected at signing: 3 (R053\\u2013R055). These are event units, not unique permanent exits.')\nr = S(r, 'Auction screen', 'Met \\u2014 more than one independent prospective acquiring bidder unit executed bidder-target confidentiality agreements for this process (11 strategic + 14 financial signers in the current attempt, R009\\u2013R010, plus Party C, R024). No lender-only, adviser or rollover-holder agreements are counted. Sample eligibility remains a separate research decision.')\nr += 1\nr = S(r, '6. COMPARABILITY AND INPUTS', '', bold_a=True)\nr = S(r, 'Unusual consideration / other scope', 'No Other-scope bids in this ledger: every priced proposal was for 100% of the equity. G&W\\u2019s July bids included a $1.13/share CVR (South Quay property sale, a contingent cash payment; dropped in the final bid). All-cash = Yes on G&W\\u2019s bids; consideration structures for the anonymous cohorts and other parties are not stated, so their all-cash flags are \\u201cNot stated\\u201d (no inference from bidder type).')\nr = S(r, 'Share counts and conversion', '4,866,593 common; 640 preferred (100-for-1 conversion; non-cumulative dividend up to $5.00/share/year). Disclosed equity values in the filing ($90\\u2013$134 million; $96\\u2013$121 million; $108 million) assume preferred conversion and a 100% common-stock basis (P-011, P-012, P-014\\u2013P-016).')\nr = S(r, 'Labelled conversion (optional)', 'Preferred consideration on the stated terms: 100 common shares per preferred share \\u00d7 $25.00 = $2,500 per preferred share, before accrued/unpaid dividends. This is a labelled arithmetic conversion of disclosed inputs (X-008, p.50), not an observed bid or market price.')\nr = S(r, 'Market benchmarks', '$16.30 close 08/12/2016 (53% premium cited); $24.88 close 09/16/2016; Q3 2016 high $25.00 (p.71).')\nr = S(r, 'Glossary', 'NDA = confidentiality/non-disclosure agreement. IOI = indication of interest (here non-binding, May\\u2013June 2016). LOI = letter of intent (here non-binding, July 2016). CVR = contingent value right ($1.13/share, tied to the South Quay property sale). Markup = proposed edits to transaction documents (not a signed agreement). STB = U.S. Surface Transportation Board. \\u201cFiduciary out\\u201d = the Board\\u2019s limited right to change its recommendation/accept a superior proposal before the shareholder vote; \\u201cmatching rights\\u201d = G&W\\u2019s right to match such a proposal. Voting trust = mechanism to hold the surviving corporation\\u2019s shares pending STB approval. Round 0 = pre-opening stage; \\u201cpost\\u201d = post-signing.')\nr = S(r, 'Workbook notes', 'Deal column value: PWRR-G&W. AI original (hidden) stores a values-only copy of the Deal ledger baseline; red-bold conditional formatting highlights any later change per Row id and column. Include = No excludes a row from Summary SUMIFS. Source links open the cited paragraph on the Source text sheet. This first pass has no reviewer edits yet.')\n\nws_sum.column_dimensions['A'].width = 30\nws_sum.column_dimensions['B'].width = 150\nws_sum.column_dimensions['C'].width = 14\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# QUESTIONS SHEET\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nQH = ['Q','Review topic','Recommended answer','Why and source','Affected rows/fields','Consequence of changing it','Status','Reviewer note']\nwrite_header(ws_que, QH)\nQUESTIONS = [\n ('Q1','Process and round map (one process; four stages and rejected anchor candidates)',\n  'Adopt one process (Process 1) with Round 0 (Q4 2015\\u201303/27/2016), Round 1 anchored on the week-of-03/28/2016 outreach, Round 2 from the 06/01/2016 advancement, Round 3 from the 07/27/2016 selection (Inferred final), plus post-signing events. Keep R003 and R005 as rejected Round 1 anchor candidates.',\n  'No abandonment, dormancy or restart is reported between the Q4 2015 approach and signing; the contacts run continuously (P-002\\u2013P-023). The first solicitation is the wave itself (P-006, p.28); the 03/24 authorization and 03/14 decision are earlier decision points kept as separate rows so the boundary can be moved.',\n  'R001, R003, R005, R006, R021, R037 (process/round; Round finality)',\n  'Moving the R1 anchor to R003/R005 changes the round in which the initial outreach sits and the stage counts; splitting into two processes would require evidence of abandonment/restart that the filing does not report.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q2','Deadline history: 05/19 treatment, 07/20 late acceptance, and the undated late-July LOI window',\n  'Keep 05/10 Extended, 05/19 Enforced, 07/20 Late bids accepted. Keep the five undated late-July LOIs on Working date 07/20 with Date from/to 07/20\\u201307/27 and note that arrivals were probably 07/20\\u201307/22 but that window is not entered as a bound.',\n  '05/10 was postponed (P-010, p.29). The nine IOIs arrived 05/19\\u201306/01 and the process advanced 06/01 (P-011, p.29); the receipt window merely straddles the 05/19 date and no individual arrival is dated after it \\u2014 the instruction treats a straddling window as not late, so Enforced; a reviewer preferring Late bids accepted for 05/19 would change R017/R016 treatment. G&W\\u2019s 07/21 LOI was considered (P-017, p.29; P-023, p.30) \\u2014 Late bids accepted for 07/20. The 07/27 meeting compared all six LOIs (P-023), so every undated LOI is established received by 07/27.',\n  'R015, R016, R017, R018, R022, R027, R028\\u2013R032 (Due date; Deadline treatment; Date from/to; Working date)',\n  'Changing 05/19 to Late bids accepted would relabel the R017 milestone and the Summary deadline map; there is no evidence to extend or revise the 07/20 date.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q3','NDA population (25 vs 26), contact reconciliation, and unresolved overlaps',\n  'Record 11 strategic + 14 financial signers for the March\\u2013April wave and Party C separately (26 signer events); treat the Reasons section\\u2019s \\u201c25\\u201d as the wave (or as an inconsistency) and flag the one-unit difference. Party B\\u2019s contact Count remains blank; the two additional Class I railroads never entered; the two non-submitting LOI bidders are from the seven-plus-Party-C stage population.',\n  'Wave narrative 11 strategic + 14 financial = 25 (P-006, p.28); Reasons says \\u201c25 of whom entered into confidentiality agreements\\u2026 and six of whom submitted non-binding letters of intent\\u201d (X-001, p.33) while the six LOIs include Party C, whose July CA is separately described (P-014, p.29). Party B\\u2019s cohort membership is not disclosed (P-008, p.28). Two Class I railroads were approached but no NDA/bid is reported (P-008). One strategic and one financial buyer elected not to submit an LOI (P-022, p.30).',\n  'R007\\u2013R010, R013, R014, R024, R025, R033, R034 (Count; population descriptions)',\n  'Deciding the 25 includes Party C would reduce the wave signers to 24 and change R009/R010 Counts and both Summary totals; treating Party B as inside the wave would allow Count 1 on R014.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q4','Bidder types and anonymity (A\\u2013F, cohorts) \\u2014 no outside identification used',\n  'Keep the filing\\u2019s role-based types: A, B, C, E, F and G&W Strategic; D Financial; the nine-IOI cohort, the two excluded bidders, the 16 non-submitters Unknown; the two non-submitting LOI bidders split Strategic/Financial as the filing supplies. Do not attempt to name any anonymous party.',\n  'Party A is a \\u201cClass I rail partner\\u201d (P-002, p.27); B and C are \\u201cpotential strategic buyer[s]\\u201d (P-008, p.28; P-014, p.29); D is \\u201ca financial buyer\\u201d (P-019, p.30); E and F are \\u201ca strategic buyer\\u201d (P-018, P-021, p.30); G&W operates railroads (X-014, p.21). The nine-IOI group and residuals carry no usable type evidence.',\n  'R001, R014, R023\\u2013R025, R028\\u2013R036, R042 (Type; identity descriptions)',\n  'Reassigning any type would change Summary participant lines and could affect cohort splits; naming anonymous parties from outside knowledge is out of scope by instruction.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q5','Inferred/closing outcomes and their agency (every inferred row grouped by transition)',\n  'Accept the closures: R019 (Did not submit, Inferred: residual \\u2014 25 \\u2212 9 = 16, working 05/19) and R033/R034 (stated non-submissions, by 07/20); R042 (Party A, Inferred: identity, Count 0, first named set excluding it 07/27); R054/R055 (D and E, Inferred: silent at the 08/12 signing). D\\u2019s 08/02 statement is treated as Participation paused, not an exit.',\n  'Bases and arithmetic are in section 10.2 of the instruction and each row\\u2019s Why cell: R019 uses the 25-signer base and nine submitters (P-006, p.28; P-011, p.29); R042 uses the 07/27 continuation of \\u201cG&W and Party B\\u201d (P-023, p.30); D/E last appear 08/02 and the next identified transition is signing (P-024, p.30; P-033, p.32). The filing does not state who the two lowest IOIs were or which anonymous exit was Party A\\u2019s.',\n  'R019, R020, R033, R034, R042, R048, R054, R055 (Outcome basis; Count; Decided by; Exit reason)',\n  'If the 25-signer base or the nine-submitter set is corrected, R019\\u2019s Count and the Round 1 balance change; if Party A is instead mapped to a named exit, only R042\\u2019s covering-row list changes \\u2014 counts must not move to the name.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q6','Formality and conditions borderline calls (including the late reconfirmation and every diligence-period Heavy)',\n  'Keep: nine-IOI cohort Informal/Heavy by context (R018); Party C IOI Informal/Heavy (R025); B\\u2019s LOI and reaffirmation Formal/Light with \\u201cDD required: confirmatory\\u201d mapping an expedited diligence review (R028, R050; R050 is a flagged late reconfirmation \\u2014 Reaffirmed by: returned draft, $24 carried forward); E\\u2019s LOIs/reversion Informal/Heavy with the 60-day exclusivity (R029, R046, R047); D Formal/Heavy (R030, R045); C and F Informal/Heavy (R031, R032); G&W Formal/Heavy for the July bids and Formal/Light for the final $25.00 bid with no diligence condition (R035, R036, R052).',\n  'Formal signals: B, G&W and D returned agreement mark-ups (P-015, p.29); E provided only an issues summary (P-015); the final G&W bid carried mark-ups and was priced during definitive negotiation (P-028, p.31). Heavy triggers are stated multi-week/exclusive diligence periods (P-016\\u2013P-021, p.29\\u201330; P-024, p.30). B\\u2019s reaffirmation meets the three-part late-reconfirmation test (P-026/P-027, p.31).',\n  'R018, R025, R028\\u2013R036, R045\\u2013R050, R052 (Formality; Conditions level; Conditions detail; Price origin)',\n  'A reviewer treating E\\u2019s issues summary as a returned markup would make E Formal; treating B\\u2019s expedited review as substantive would make B Heavy; either change alters the deal-history reading but not the outcome.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q7','Working-date conventions that decide row order (05/19 IOI window, mid-June, early-July Party C, the five undated LOIs vs G&W 07/21, deadline-revision window, 07/29 re-entries)',\n  'Keep the assigned Working dates and the disclosed methods: R018 05/19 (Assigned: deadline); R022 06/15 (midpoint of 06/11\\u201319); R023/R024 07/05 (midpoint of 07/01\\u201310; R024 Assigned: sequence); R028\\u2013R032 07/20 (Assigned: deadline) displayed before G&W\\u2019s 07/21 exact LOI \\u2014 their relative order is not known and is a display convention only; R016 05/08 (midpoint of the derived 04/28\\u201305/18 window); R038\\u2013R042 07/27 (Assigned: decision day).',\n  'The instruction\\u2019s date rules and the filing\\u2019s own sequencing (P-010, P-012, P-014\\u2013P-017, P-023). Example: the five undated LOIs cannot be shown to have arrived before G&W\\u2019s 07/21 LOI or after their 07/20 deadline; the ledger sorts them at the deadline and says so (R028\\u2013R032).',\n  'R016, R018, R022\\u2013R034, R038\\u2013R044 (Working date; Date basis; Date method; # order)',\n  'Moving any assigned date within its own window would change # order and possibly stage counts; reported and inferred dates are not moved.',\n  'Pending',''),\n ('Q8','Post-signing matters, contingent consideration and comparability inputs',\n  'Keep the 09/06/2016 BMO conflict row as a Material process update (R058); keep the CVR ($1.13/share, South Quay) only in G&W\\u2019s July bid rows and the Summary; keep the preferred 100-for-1 conversion and the labelled $2,500 per preferred share conversion in the Summary; no go-shop and no observed post-signing competing proposal.',\n  'Background p.32 (P-034) and the financial-analysis Miscellaneous section (X-006/X-007, p.41\\u201342: ~5% affiliate participation; $1\\u20135 million revenue since 01/01/2014). CVR defined in P-017, p.29. Consideration X-008, p.50. No go-shop provision appears in the merger-agreement summaries reviewed.',\n  'R035, R036, R052, R056, R058 (Terms; All cash; Cash at closing; Summary comparability)',\n  'Treating the CVR as non-cash or ignoring the BMO relationship would misstate G&W\\u2019s July consideration or the adviser-conflict record; the preferred conversion changes only the Summary conversion, not per-common-share bids.',\n  'Pending',''),\n]\nqr = 2\nfor qrow in QUESTIONS:\n    for c, v in enumerate(qrow, start=1):\n        cell = put(ws_que, qr, c, v)\n    if qrow[6] == 'Pending':\n        ws_que.cell(row=qr, column=7).alignment = WRAP_C\n    ws_que.row_dimensions[qr].height = 150\n    qr += 1\nqr += 1\nws_que.cell(row=qr, column=1, value='SECTION 13 CHECK RESULTS (run on this delivered version)').font = BOLD\nqr += 1\nCHECKS = [\n ('1. Coverage and materiality','Passed with qualifications','All disclosed core offers, contacts/NDAs, selections, outcomes, deadlines, signing and publicity are represented (R001\\u2013R058). Qualifications: no go-shop exists and no post-signing competition is reported, so none appears; contact-only parties (two Class I railroads) and never-admitted parties have no outcome rows by convention. Routine meetings were folded into related rows.'),\n ('2. Counts and population','Qualified','Ledger formulas: contacts 33 units; NDA signers 26 events; round-bidder tallies 9 / 6 / 4. Filing assertions retained: 11+18 contacted; 25 NDA signers; nine IOIs; six LOIs. Unresolved: 25 vs 26 signer reconciliation (Q3) and Party B\\u2019s blank contact Count. Per-stage balance shown in Summary section 5; alternative counts are qualified rather than forced.'),\n ('3. Participation continuity','Passed with qualifications','Every entered participant ends in a stated outcome, an inferred closing row, or signing; re-entries recorded for D/E (R043\\u2013R044). Qualifications: Party A\\u2019s exit is a Count-0 identity row (Q5), and the two non-submitting LOI bidders and 16 non-submitters are anonymous residuals. Stock per stage: R1 25\\u221216\\u22122=7; R2 8\\u22122\\u22124=2; R3 2+2\\u22123=1 (winner).'),\n ('4. Dates and order','Passed (programmatic)','Sorting by Working date then # reproduces # order (verified by code); no Working date falls outside its own Date from/to; Reported/Inferred labels match Date basis; deadline communication, deadlines and signing are distinct. Application-level date checking (Excel recalculation) not performed.'),\n ('5. Offers and classifications','Passed with qualifications','Every Bid and Bid reaffirmed row has Formality, Conditions level and a fixed-format Conditions detail string (verified by code); price kinds/origins, currencies and cash flags agree with the text; signing, reaffirmations, reversions and group envelope are not counted as separate priced submissions. Qualifications: Q6 borderline calls (E\\u2019s issues-summary formality; mapping expedited review to confirmatory).'),\n ('6. Structure and consistency','Passed (programmatic)','Each numbered round has exactly one Round opened row (R006, R021, R037) with a Round finality value; R006 carries the R1 anchor tag with rejected candidates; every Deadline row has a treatment matching the Summary map; every inferred row opens with its Outcome basis; Page is filled wherever Source is; Date basis/Date method pairs are permitted.'),\n ('7. Evidence','Passed with declared normalization','Every quotation in Why and evidence was checked programmatically as an exact substring of its cited Source text paragraph (curly quotes and whitespace normalized only at layout level). Interpretation over and above the quotations (rounds, conventions, agency) is argued in the cells and Questions. Text matching alone is not proof of interpretation.'),\n ('8. Review and workbook operation','Qualified','Question links and affected rows resolve to defined Row ids; validations reference the Lists sheet; AI original matches the ledger baseline (row-by-row value comparison by Row id performed); conditional formatting highlights changes by Row id/column. Not performed in Excel: formula recalculation, drop-down and hyperlink behavior, and print/layout inspection; a LibreOffice open/save smoke test was used where available.'),\n]\nfor name, status, note in CHECKS:\n    put(ws_que, qr, 1, name).font = BOLD\n    put(ws_que, qr, 2, status)\n    put(ws_que, qr, 3, note)\n    ws_que.merge_cells(start_row=qr, start_column=3, end_row=qr, end_column=8)\n    ws_que.row_dimensions[qr].height = 78\n    qr += 1\nws_que.column_dimensions['A'].width = 8\nws_que.column_dimensions['B'].width = 34\nws_que.column_dimensions['C'].width = 52\nws_que.column_dimensions['D'].width = 52\nws_que.column_dimensions['E'].width = 30\nws_que.column_dimensions['F'].width = 40\nws_que.column_dimensions['G'].width = 10\nws_que.column_dimensions['H'].width = 24\nws_que.freeze_panes = 'A2'\n\n# workbook properties\nwb.properties.title = 'PWRR / G&W deal ledger (SEC Dealer Ledger Extraction, Pro revision 19 Sep 2026)'\nwb.properties.creator = 'AI extraction first pass'\nwb.properties.description = 'Extraction from DEFM14A filed 2016-09-20 (Providence & Worcester / Genesee & Wyoming).'\n\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT), exist_ok=True)\nwb.save(OUT)\nprint('saved', OUT, 'rows', len(ROWS))\n"},"output":"Created file successfully: /tmp/opencode/build_workbook.py","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: /tmp/opencode/build_workbook.py"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/build_workbook.py\", \"content\": \"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n# Build providence-worcester.xlsx (PWRR / G&W deal ledger) per SEC_Deal_Ledger_Extraction_Instruction.md (Pro, 19 Sep 2026)\\nimport json, datetime as dt, re, os\\nfrom openpyxl import Workbook\\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, Alignment, PatternFill, Border, Side\\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\\nfrom openpyxl.worksheet.datavalidation import DataValidation\\nfrom openpyxl.formatting.rule import FormulaRule\\nfrom openpyxl.worksheet.hyperlink import Hyperlink\\n\\nBASE = '/tmp/opencode'\\nOUT = '/home/uctpiaj/work/extraction/providence-worcester.xlsx'\\nblocks = [t for p, t in json.load(open(f'{BASE}/blocks_pages.json'))]\\nbpage = [p for p, t in json.load(open(f'{BASE}/blocks_pages.json'))]\\n\\ndef q(i, snippet):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Exact quotation helper: asserts snippet in block i, returns curly-quoted text.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    t = blocks[i]\\n    assert snippet in t, f'QUOTE NOT FOUND in block {i}: {snippet[:80]}...'\\n    return '\\\\u201c' + snippet + '\\\\u201d'\\n\\nD = dt.date\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# SOURCE TEXT SHEET\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# Background: blocks 548..581 -> P-001..P-034\\nP_ROWS = []\\nCONT = {551, 557, 573, 578}  # continuation paragraphs after page break\\nfor k, b in enumerate(range(548, 582)):\\n    pid = f'P-{k+1:03d}'\\n    sec = 'Background of the Merger'\\n    if b in CONT:\\n        sec += ' (continuation of previous paragraph)'\\n    P_ROWS.append([pid, sec, bpage[b], blocks[b]])\\n\\nX_SPEC = [\\n    (588, 'Recommendation of the Board and Reasons for the Merger (process and counts)'),\\n    (591, 'Recommendation of the Board and Reasons for the Merger (premium)'),\\n    (602, 'Recommendation of the Board and Reasons for the Merger (no financing condition)'),\\n    (297, 'Summary - Market Price of Common Stock'),\\n    (737, 'Summary of Financial Analysis of BMO Capital Markets Corp. - Miscellaneous (fees and relationships)'),\\n    (738, 'Summary of Financial Analysis - BMO relationships (continuation)'),\\n    (739, 'Summary of Financial Analysis - BMO relationships (BMO affiliate lender in G&W facility)'),\\n    (870, 'The Merger Agreement - Merger Consideration'),\\n    (889, 'The Merger Agreement - Conditions to the Merger (STB condition)'),\\n    (930, 'The Merger Agreement - Termination Fee'),\\n    (1025, 'Regulatory Approvals Required for the Merger'),\\n    (1026, 'Regulatory Approvals Required for the Merger (continuation, September 2016 filings)'),\\n    (1168, 'The Voting Agreement'),\\n    (471, 'The Parties to the Merger Agreement - Genesee & Wyoming Inc.'),\\n    (547, 'Proposal No. 1 - The Merger (General; consideration)'),\\n    (260, 'The Merger Agreement - Termination of the Merger Agreement (outside date)'),\\n]\\nX_ROWS = [[f'X-{i+1:03d}', sec, bpage[b], blocks[b]] for i, (b, sec) in enumerate(X_SPEC)]\\nXIDX = {f'X-{i+1:03d}': b for i, (b, sec) in enumerate(X_SPEC)}\\n\\nSRC = {}\\nfor pid, sec, p, t in P_ROWS + X_ROWS:\\n    SRC[pid] = (p, t)\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# LEDGER ROWS\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# field list: rid, n, when, who, what, proc, rnd, typ, terms, formality, cond, why, src, link, review,\\n#             count, dfrom, dto, wdate, dbasis, dmethod, plow, phigh, pkind, porigin, ccy,\\n#             allcash, cashclose, conddetail, duedate, dtreat, rfinal, decidedby, exitreason, obasis,\\n#             page, related, deal\\nROWS = []\\ndef add(**kw):\\n    base = dict(typ=None, formality=None, cond=None, review='', count=None, dfrom=None, dto=None,\\n                dbasis=None, dmethod=None, plow=None, phigh=None, pkind=None, porigin=None,\\n                ccy=None, allcash=None, cashclose=None, conddetail=None, duedate=None, dtreat=None,\\n                rfinal=None, decidedby=None, exitreason=None, obasis=None, related='')\\n    base.update(kw)\\n    ROWS.append(base)\\n\\nDEAL = 'PWRR-G&W'\\n\\n# 1. Party A approach\\nadd(rid='R001', n=1, when='Fourth quarter of 2015 (exact date not disclosed)',\\n    who='Party A (a Class I rail partner of the Company)', what='Bidder interest', proc=1, rnd='0', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Unpriced acquisition interest: during a meeting on joint commercial opportunities between Company CEO Eder and VP Rogers and Party A, Party A suggested possible joint venture arrangements and expressed some interest in acquiring equity in the Company. Direction: bidder acquisition interest expressed at a Company-initiated commercial meeting; led to the Board\\\\u2019s banker search and the broad sale process.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(549, 'met with one of the Company\\\\u2019s Class I rail partners (\\\\u201cParty A\\\\u201d) to discuss joint commercial opportunities. During the meeting, Party A suggested possible joint venture arrangements and expressed some interest in acquiring equity in the Company') + ' (P-002, p.27). Convention: quarter preserved as an interval; working date is the midpoint (Assigned: midpoint).',\\n    src='P-002', link='P-002', review='Q1; Q4', count=1, dfrom=D(2015,10,1), dto=D(2015,12,31), wdate=D(2015,11,15),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', page=27, related='R007 (11-strategic cohort includes Party A); R042 (identity exit row)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 2. GHF engagement\\nadd(rid='R002', n=2, when='01/27/2016', who='GHF (Greene Holcomb & Fisher LLC), financial adviser to the Company',\\n    what='Adviser engaged', proc=1, rnd='0',\\n    terms='Financial adviser to the Company. Engagement approved at the Board\\\\u2019s executive session after the two-director subcommittee (Frank W. Barrett; Richard W. Anderson) interviewed several firms; GHF represented it would not represent any potential buyer of the Company or any person proposing financing; selection rationale: rail-sector experience (including a recent short-line sale). GHF\\\\u2019s business was acquired by BMO Capital Markets Corp. on 08/01/2016 \\\\u2014 one continuing adviser relationship (no second adviser row); disclosed aggregate fee ~$2.52 million (X-005, p.41).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(549, 'During the executive session of the Board\\\\u2019s regular quarterly meeting held on January 27, 2016 (which Director Alfred P. Smith did not attend), the subcommittee recommended to the Board that the Company retain GHF as its investment banking firm.') + ' ... ' + q(549, 'Following this presentation, the Board approved the subcommittee\\\\u2019s recommendation and the Company engaged GHF.') + ' (P-002, p.27).',\\n    src='P-002; X-005', link='P-002', count=None, dfrom=D(2016,1,27), dto=D(2016,1,27), wdate=D(2016,1,27),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=27, related='R003; R058', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 3. Board sale decision\\nadd(rid='R003', n=3, when='03/14/2016', who='Board of Directors (Transaction Committee appointed)',\\n    what='Target sale decision', proc=1, rnd='0',\\n    terms='Board approved proceeding with GHF\\\\u2019s proposed process \\\\u2014 discussions with Party A plus soliciting interest from other third parties in a change in control transaction \\\\u2014 and appointed the Transaction Committee (Frank W. Barrett (Chair), Richard W. Anderson, James C. Garvey) to supervise the process for the full Board; the Committee cannot approve a change of control (full-Board authority under Rhode Island law). Kept as a rejected Round 1 anchor candidate: the decision preceded the actual solicitation (R005\\\\u2013R006).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(550, 'Representatives of GHF then proposed a process pursuant to which the Company would proceed with discussions with Party A and also solicit interest from other potential third parties regarding a change in control transaction.') + ' ... ' + q(551, 'and its shareholders to proceed with the transaction strategy discussed with representatives of GHF.') + ' (P-003, p.27; P-004, p.28).',\\n    src='P-003; P-004', link='P-003', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,3,14), dto=D(2016,3,14), wdate=D(2016,3,14),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=27, related='R006 (rejected R1 anchor candidate)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 4. Party A management meeting\\nadd(rid='R004', n=4, when='03/22/2016\\\\u201303/23/2016', who='Company management (CFO Daniel T. Noreck and senior management) and Party A',\\n    what='Contact', proc=1, rnd='0', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Pre-solicitation contact: senior management met representatives of Party A and informed Party A of GHF\\\\u2019s engagement. Count 0 \\\\u2014 Party A is already represented (R001 first contact; inside the R007 11-strategic cohort).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(552, 'On March 22, 2016 and March 23, 2016, Daniel T. Noreck (the Company\\\\u2019s Chief Financial Officer and Treasurer) and other members of the senior management team of the Company met with various representatives of Party A.') + ' ... ' + q(553, 'had informed Party A of GHF\\\\u2019s engagement.') + ' (P-005, p.28; P-006, p.28). Convention: event spans two days; working date is the first day (Assigned: bound).',\\n    src='P-005; P-006', link='P-005', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,3,22), dto=D(2016,3,23), wdate=D(2016,3,22),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: bound', page=28, related='covers R001; covered by R007', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 5. TC authorization\\nadd(rid='R005', n=5, when='03/24/2016', who='Transaction Committee', what='Target decision', proc=1, rnd='0',\\n    terms='Committee authorized GHF to contact Party A and other potential buyers to determine their level of interest in a change in control transaction. Kept as a rejected Round 1 anchor candidate: an authorization is not the completed outreach (R006).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(553, 'The Transaction Committee authorized GHF to contact Party A as well as other potential buyers to determine their level of interest in a change in control transaction.') + ' (P-006, p.28).',\\n    src='P-006', link='P-006', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,3,24), dto=D(2016,3,24), wdate=D(2016,3,24),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=28, related='R006 (rejected R1 anchor candidate)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 6. Round 1 opened\\nadd(rid='R006', n=6, when='Week of 03/28/2016', who='Transaction Committee / GHF (the Company\\\\u2019s financial adviser)',\\n    what='Round opened', proc=1, rnd='1',\\n    terms='R1 anchor: first outreach wave (week of 03/28/2016) \\\\u2014 GHF contacted 11 potential strategic buyers (including Party A) and 18 potential financial buyers (29 total). Other candidate anchors rejected: R005 (03/24/2016 Transaction Committee authorization \\\\u2014 rejected: the wave itself is the reported first solicitation) and R003 (03/14/2016 Board decision to proceed \\\\u2014 rejected: solicitation began only after the 03/24 authorization). Objective: non-binding IOIs. Round finality: Not final \\\\u2014 no final/binding stage announced; the round sought non-binding indications (P-011, p.29).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(553, 'During the week of March 28, 2016, in accordance with the Transaction Committee\\\\u2019s directives, representatives of GHF contacted 11 potential strategic buyers (including Party A) and 18 potential financial buyers.') + ' (P-006, p.28). Convention: \\\\u201cweek of\\\\u201d window 03/28\\\\u201304/03 with midpoint working date 03/31; anchor adopted per the smallest-map rule.',\\n    src='P-006; P-011', link='P-006', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,3,28), dto=D(2016,4,3), wdate=D(2016,3,31),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', rfinal='Not final', page=28, related='R003; R005 (candidate anchors)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 7-8. Contact cohorts\\nadd(rid='R007', n=7, when='Week of 03/28/2016', who='11 potential strategic buyers (including Party A and G&W)',\\n    what='Contact', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Outreach to determine interest in a change in control transaction; all 11 subsequently executed confidentiality agreements (R009). Count 11 \\\\u2014 size of the disclosed strategic cohort.',\\n    why='Stated. Same wave quotation as R006 (P-006, p.28); ' + q(553, 'Each of the potential strategic buyers and 14 potential financial buyers subsequently executed confidentiality agreements.') + ' (P-006, p.28).',\\n    src='P-006', link='P-006', count=11, dfrom=D(2016,3,28), dto=D(2016,4,3), wdate=D(2016,3,31),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', page=28, related='R009 (NDA cohort)', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R008', n=8, when='Week of 03/28/2016', who='18 potential financial buyers', what='Contact', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='Outreach to determine interest; 14 of the 18 subsequently executed confidentiality agreements (R010). Count 18 contacted (not the 14 signers).',\\n    why='Stated. Same wave quotation as R006 (P-006, p.28); of the 18 contacted, ' + q(553, '14 potential financial buyers subsequently executed confidentiality agreements') + ' (P-006, p.28).',\\n    src='P-006', link='P-006', count=18, dfrom=D(2016,3,28), dto=D(2016,4,3), wdate=D(2016,3,31),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', page=28, related='R010 (NDA cohort)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 9-10. NDA cohorts\\nadd(rid='R009', n=9, when='After the week of 03/28/2016; exact dates not disclosed',\\n    who='11 potential strategic buyers (including Party A and G&W)', what='NDA signed', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Executed acquisition-related confidentiality agreements; no \\\\u201cstandstill\\\\u201d or similar provision restricting proposals. Signers received the Company memorandum in late April 2016 (folded here; no separate row per section 4). Includes Party A, G&W and (by the filing\\\\u2019s description of memorandum recipients) Party B.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(553, 'Each of the potential strategic buyers and 14 potential financial buyers subsequently executed confidentiality agreements. The confidentiality agreements did not contain any \\\\u201cstandstill\\\\u201d or similar provision that would prohibit a potential buyer from submitting a proposal or making an offer to acquire the Company.') + ' (P-006, p.28). Convention: execution day not disclosed; working date follows the outreach rows (Assigned: sequence).',\\n    src='P-006; P-009', link='P-006', review='Q3', count=11, dfrom=D(2016,3,28), wdate=D(2016,3,31),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: sequence', page=28, related='R007 (contacts); R014 (Party B); R042 (Party A)', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R010', n=10, when='After the week of 03/28/2016; exact dates not disclosed',\\n    who='14 potential financial buyers', what='NDA signed', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='14 of the 18 contacted financial buyers executed confidentiality agreements; no \\\\u201cstandstill\\\\u201d provision. Signers received the Company memorandum in late April 2016 (folded here).',\\n    why='Stated. Same quotation as R009 (P-006, p.28). Convention: execution day not disclosed; working date follows the outreach rows (Assigned: sequence).',\\n    src='P-006; P-009', link='P-006', review='Q3', count=14, dfrom=D(2016,3,28), wdate=D(2016,3,31),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: sequence', page=28, related='R008 (contacts)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 11. Convention meetings\\nadd(rid='R011', n=11, when='04/03/2016\\\\u201304/06/2016',\\n    who='Five potential strategic buyers (including G&W); GHF and Company management', what='Contact', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Series of introductory meetings at the 2016 Connections Convention. Count 0 \\\\u2014 these five are inside the R007 11-strategic cohort; first reported event naming G&W.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(554, 'Between April 3, 2016 and April 6, 2016, representatives of GHF and members of the Company\\\\u2019s management held a series of introductory meetings with five potential strategic buyers (including G&W) at the American Short Line and Regional Railroad Association\\\\u2019s 2016 Connections Convention') + ' (P-007, p.28). Convention: event spans four days; working date is the first day (Assigned: bound).',\\n    src='P-007', link='P-007', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,4,3), dto=D(2016,4,6), wdate=D(2016,4,3),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: bound', page=28, related='covered by R007', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 12. April 7 TC decision\\nadd(rid='R012', n=12, when='04/07/2016', who='Transaction Committee', what='Target decision', proc=1, rnd='1',\\n    terms='Committee authorized GHF to confirm continuing interest with the five convention parties, other potential strategic buyers (including certain Class I railroads) and private equity firms that had signed confidentiality agreements; CFO Noreck reported two additional Class I railroads had also been approached (R013).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(555, 'the Transaction Committee authorized representatives of GHF, on behalf of the Company, to contact each of the five interested parties with whom management had met at the 2016 Connections Convention, as well as other potential strategic buyers (including certain Class I railroads) and private equity firms who had entered into confidentiality agreements with the Company to confirm their continuing interest.') + ' (P-008, p.28).',\\n    src='P-008', link='P-008', dfrom=D(2016,4,7), dto=D(2016,4,7), wdate=D(2016,4,7),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=28, related='R013', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 13. Two additional Class I railroads\\nadd(rid='R013', n=13, when='On or before 04/07/2016 (report date; earlier contacts not dated)',\\n    who='Two additional Class I railroads', what='Contact', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Target-side approaches to determine interest in a possible transaction; additional to the 11 strategic buyers contacted in the March wave. No NDA, bid or outcome is reported: these contact-only parties never entered the process (no closing row).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(555, 'Mr. Noreck reported that the Company had also approached two additional Class I railroads to determine their interest in a possible transaction.') + ' (P-008, p.28). Convention: reported 04/07/2016 only; earlier date not disclosed, so the report day is the assigned bound.',\\n    src='P-008', link='P-008', review='Q3', count=2, dto=D(2016,4,7), wdate=D(2016,4,7),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: bound', page=28, related='', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 14. Party B first meeting\\nadd(rid='R014', n=14, when='04/21/2016', who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Contact', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Company and GHF held an introductory meeting with Party B; Party B had executed a confidentiality agreement by late April (received the Company memorandum). Count left blank: whether Party B is inside the 11-strategic contact cohort (R007) is not disclosed \\\\u2014 unresolved overlap, not silently zero.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(555, 'Subsequently, on April 21, 2016, the Company and representatives of GHF held an introductory meeting with another potential strategic buyer (\\\\u201cParty B\\\\u201d).') + ' (P-008, p.28). Overlap qualification: R009 (memo recipients include Party B).',\\n    src='P-008; P-009', link='P-008', review='Q3', dfrom=D(2016,4,21), dto=D(2016,4,21), wdate=D(2016,4,21),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=28, related='R009; R028', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 15. IOI deadline set\\nadd(rid='R015', n=15, when='04/27/2016', who='Board of Directors (executive session, without Mr. Eder present)',\\n    what='Deadline set', proc=1, rnd='1',\\n    terms='Each potential buyer advised to submit a non-binding indication of interest by 05/10/2016. Deadline treatment: Extended (postponed to 05/19/2016, R016).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(557, 'each potential buyer had been advised to submit a non-binding indication of interest by May 10, 2016 (which deadline was subsequently postponed to May 19, 2016 to ensure the potential buyers had sufficient time to formulate their most compelling offers)') + ' (P-010, p.29).',\\n    src='P-010', link='P-010', review='Q2', dfrom=D(2016,4,27), dto=D(2016,4,27), wdate=D(2016,4,27),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', duedate=D(2016,5,10), dtreat='Extended', page=29, related='R016; R017', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 16. Deadline revised\\nadd(rid='R016', n=16, when='After 04/27/2016; before 05/19/2016 (exact date not disclosed)',\\n    who='Company (Transaction Committee process)', what='Deadline revised', proc=1, rnd='1',\\n    terms='IOI deadline postponed from 05/10/2016 to 05/19/2016 \\\\u201c to ensure the potential buyers had sufficient time to formulate their most compelling offers\\\\u201d; requester not disclosed. Deadline treatment shown for the replacement date (R017).',\\n    why='Stated (postponement and reason). ' + q(557, 'which deadline was subsequently postponed to May 19, 2016 to ensure the potential buyers had sufficient time to formulate their most compelling offers') + ' (P-010, p.29). Convention: postponement date not disclosed; bounded 04/28\\\\u201305/18 (after the 04/27/2016 meeting, before the new date); working date is the midpoint.',\\n    src='P-010', link='P-010', review='Q2', dfrom=D(2016,4,28), dto=D(2016,5,18), wdate=D(2016,5,8),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', duedate=D(2016,5,19), dtreat='Enforced', page=29, related='R015; R017', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 17. IOI deadline milestone\\nadd(rid='R017', n=17, when='05/19/2016', who='Company (IOI deadline)', what='Deadline', proc=1, rnd='1',\\n    terms='IOI due date. Treatment Enforced: the date passed with no extension and the target took its next step (review of the nine IOIs at the 05/23 and 06/01 committee meetings; exclusion of two low bidders; advancement of seven). The receipt window 05/19\\\\u201306/01 straddles the due date and no individual arrival dates are disclosed, so no arrival is treated as late (alternative reading flagged in Q2).',\\n    why='Stated (due date and what followed). ' + q(558, 'Between May 19, 2016 and June 1, 2016, the Company received nine written indications of interest (\\\\u201cIOIs\\\\u201d) from potential buyers') + ' ... ' + q(558, 'The Transaction Committee met by telephone conference on May 23, 2016 and again on June 1, 2016 to consider the IOIs.') + ' (P-011, p.29).',\\n    src='P-011', link='P-011', review='Q2', dfrom=D(2016,5,19), dto=D(2016,5,19), wdate=D(2016,5,19),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', duedate=D(2016,5,19), dtreat='Enforced', page=29, related='R015; R016; R018', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 18. Nine IOIs\\nadd(rid='R018', n=18, when='Between 05/19/2016 and 06/01/2016',\\n    who='Nine IOI bidders (unidentified group of potential buyers)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Unknown',\\n    terms='Nine written non-binding IOIs; offer prices $17.93\\\\u2013$26.50 per share (assuming conversion of preferred stock into common stock), implying equity values of $90 million\\\\u2013$134 million. Group price envelope applies only to this group, not to each member. Preliminary indications made before substantive diligence access (data-site access and management presentations came only after the 06/01 decision) \\\\u2014 assessed Informal / Heavy by context.',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(558, 'the Company received nine written indications of interest (\\\\u201cIOIs\\\\u201d) from potential buyers, with offer prices per share ranging from $17.93 to $26.50 (assuming the conversion of preferred stock into common stock), implying equity values of $90 million to $134 million') + ' (P-011, p.29). Convention: Group envelope; formality default Informal (no formal signal reported); conditions Heavy by context (before substantive diligence access; ' + q(558, 'These potential buyers were given access to an internet data site to conduct legal and financial due diligence.') + ', P-011, p.29); working date = the due date inside the response window (Assigned: deadline).',\\n    src='P-011', link='P-011', review='Q2; Q6', count=9, dfrom=D(2016,5,19), dto=D(2016,6,1), wdate=D(2016,5,19),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=17.93, phigh=26.50, pkind='Group envelope', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: not stated; DD open: no; Excl: not stated', page=29, related='R020 (non-submitter residual); R019 (two low bidders)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 19. Non-submitting residual\\nadd(rid='R019', n=19, when='By 05/19/2016', who='16 non-submitting NDA signers (residual cohort)', what='Did not submit', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Unknown',\\n    terms='Inferred: residual \\\\u2014 25 NDA signers (R009+R010) \\\\u2212 9 IOI submitters (R018) = 16 non-submitters. Base assumes all 25 initial signers were eligible for the IOI solicitation (P-010, p.29); may include Party A (see R042).',\\n    why='Inferred: residual. Base: ' + q(553, 'Each of the potential strategic buyers and 14 potential financial buyers subsequently executed confidentiality agreements.') + ' (P-006, p.28); ' + q(558, 'the Company received nine written indications of interest (\\\\u201cIOIs\\\\u201d) from potential buyers') + ' (P-011, p.29). Closing convention (section 10.2): no submission reported; agency and reason not established from the arithmetic.',\\n    src='P-006; P-011', link='P-011', review='Q5', count=16, dto=D(2016,5,19), wdate=D(2016,5,19),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', decidedby='Unknown', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: residual',\\n    page=29, related='R009; R010; R042 (possible member)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 20. Two low bidders excluded\\nadd(rid='R020', n=20, when='06/01/2016 (decision reached over the 05/23 and 06/01 meetings)',\\n    who='Two lowest-priced IOI bidders (unidentified)', what='Dropped by target', proc=1, rnd='1', typ='Unknown',\\n    terms='Stated exclusion from management presentations and further diligence because management time for presentations was substantial; the two lowest of the nine IOIs. Stage left: Round 1. Identity of the two lowest is not disclosed.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(558, 'In view of the substantial amount of management time that would be required for management presentations, the Transaction Committee concluded that the two low bidders should be excluded from that process.') + ' (P-011, p.29). Convention: decision spans the 05/23 and 06/01 meetings; working date is the last meeting day (Assigned: decision day).',\\n    src='P-011', link='P-011', review='Q5', count=2, dfrom=D(2016,5,23), dto=D(2016,6,1), wdate=D(2016,6,1),\\n    dbasis='Reported interval', dmethod='Assigned: decision day', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Lower offer than rivals', obasis='Stated',\\n    page=29, related='R018 (source group); R042 (possible member)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 21. Round 2 opened\\nadd(rid='R021', n=21, when='06/01/2016', who='Transaction Committee', what='Round opened', proc=1, rnd='2',\\n    terms='Advancement: seven of the nine IOI bidders selected for in-person management presentations and additional due diligence; internet data-site access granted to those seven; two low bidders excluded (R020). Objective: presentations, diligence and non-binding LOIs. Round finality: Not final \\\\u2014 no final/binding stage announced; the next offers were non-binding LOIs (P-012, p.29).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(558, 'The Transaction Committee authorized representatives of GHF to schedule in-person management presentations with the remaining seven potential buyers and allow these parties to conduct additional due diligence. These potential buyers were given access to an internet data site to conduct legal and financial due diligence.') + ' (P-011, p.29).',\\n    src='P-011; P-012', link='P-011', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,6,1), dto=D(2016,6,1), wdate=D(2016,6,1),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', rfinal='Not final', page=29, related='R020; R023', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 22. LOI deadline set\\nadd(rid='R022', n=22, when='Mid-June 2016 (exact date not disclosed)', who='Transaction Committee / GHF',\\n    what='Deadline set', proc=1, rnd='2',\\n    terms='All potential buyers instructed to submit non-binding LOIs by 07/20/2016, together with mark-ups of the merger agreement, disclosure letter and voting agreement to be posted to the data site; valuation to be per share for 100% of the outstanding common stock (assuming preferred conversion) or the financial terms of any non-cash proposal. Drafts posted: merger agreement 06/29/2016; voting agreement (Eder Trusts shares) 06/30/2016; disclosure letter 07/11/2016 (P-013, p.29). Deadline treatment of the 07/20 date: Late bids accepted (R027).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(559, 'In mid-June 2016, at the direction of the Transaction Committee, representatives of GHF instructed all potential buyers to submit non-binding letters of intent (\\\\u201cLOIs\\\\u201d) by July 20, 2016, together with mark-ups of the forms of merger agreement, disclosure letter and voting agreement, which GHF indicated would be posted to the internet data site.') + ' (P-012, p.29). Convention: \\\\u201cmid-June\\\\u201d band 06/11\\\\u201306/19; working date is the midpoint.',\\n    src='P-012; P-013', link='P-012', review='Q2', dfrom=D(2016,6,11), dto=D(2016,6,19), wdate=D(2016,6,15),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', duedate=D(2016,7,20), dtreat='Late bids accepted', page=29, related='R027', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 23. Party C approach\\nadd(rid='R023', n=23, when='Early July 2016 (exact date not disclosed)',\\n    who='Party C (potential strategic buyer; new entrant)', what='Bidder interest', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Party C approached the Company\\\\u2019s management and expressed interest in acquiring the Company; it had not previously been part of the process. Direction: inbound. Count 1 \\\\u2014 newly represented prospective buyer (first-contact fact carried here).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(561, 'In early July 2016, a potential strategic buyer that had not previously been part of the process (\\\\u201cParty C\\\\u201d) approached the Company\\\\u2019s management and expressed interest in acquiring the Company.') + ' (P-014, p.29). Convention: \\\\u201cearly July\\\\u201d band 07/01\\\\u201307/10; working date is the midpoint.',\\n    src='P-014', link='P-014', review='Q3', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,1), dto=D(2016,7,10), wdate=D(2016,7,5),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: midpoint', page=29, related='R024; R025', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 24. Party C NDA\\nadd(rid='R024', n=24, when='Early July 2016 (exact date not disclosed)', who='Party C', what='NDA signed', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Party C executed a confidentiality agreement and was then provided the memorandum concerning the Company that the other potential buyers had received. Count 1. Execution day not disclosed; working date follows R023 (Assigned: sequence on the early-July band).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(561, 'After executing a confidentiality agreement, Party C was provided the memorandum concerning the Company provided to the other potential buyers.') + ' (P-014, p.29).',\\n    src='P-014', link='P-014', review='Q3', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,1), dto=D(2016,7,10), wdate=D(2016,7,5),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: sequence', page=29, related='R023; R025; R026', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 25. Party C IOI\\nadd(rid='R025', n=25, when='07/12/2016', who='Party C', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='IOI at $21.00 per share, implying an equity value of $108 million; made before substantive diligence access (data-site access and a management presentation followed, R026).',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(561, 'On July 12, 2016, Party C submitted an IOI with an offer price per share of $21.00 (implying an equity value of $108 million).') + ' (P-014, p.29). Convention: IOI with no formal documentation \\\\u2014 Informal; Heavy by context (no substantive diligence access before the indication, P-014, p.29).',\\n    src='P-014', link='P-014', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,12), dto=D(2016,7,12), wdate=D(2016,7,12),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=21.00, phigh=21.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: not stated; DD open: no; Excl: not stated', page=29,\\n    related='R026 (catch-up access); R031 (later LOI)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 26. Party C access\\nadd(rid='R026', n=26, when='07/14/2016', who='Party C', what='Information access changed', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Late-entrant catch-up access: after its 07/12/2016 IOI, Party C was provided access to the internet data site and the Company held a management presentation with Party C by telephone. The seven bidders already in the process had received data-site access from 06/01/2016 (R021); no access was withheld from others.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(561, 'Subsequently, Party C was provided access to the internet data site and the Company\\\\u2019s management held a management presentation with Party C by telephone on July 14, 2016.') + ' (P-014, p.29).',\\n    src='P-014', link='P-014', count=None, dfrom=D(2016,7,14), dto=D(2016,7,14), wdate=D(2016,7,14),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=29, related='R021; R025', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 27. LOI deadline milestone\\nadd(rid='R027', n=27, when='07/20/2016', who='Company (LOI and mark-up deadline)', what='Deadline', proc=1, rnd='2',\\n    terms='Due date for non-binding LOIs and mark-ups. Treatment Late bids accepted: G&W\\\\u2019s LOI was submitted 07/21/2016 and was reviewed with the others at the 07/22 and 07/27 committee meetings; no revision of the date is reported.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(559, 'by July 20, 2016') + ' (P-012, p.29); ' + q(564, 'G&W submitted an LOI on July 21, 2016 to acquire the Company for a price of $21.15 per share') + ' (P-017, p.29); ' + q(570, 'The Transaction Committee met by telephone conference on July 22, 2016 and in person after the regular quarterly Board meeting on July 27, 2016, to review the LOIs with representatives of GHF.') + ' (P-023, p.30).',\\n    src='P-012; P-017; P-023', link='P-012', review='Q2', dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,20), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', duedate=D(2016,7,20), dtreat='Late bids accepted', page=30, related='R022; R035', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 28-32. Late-July LOIs (five undated, working 07/20)\\nadd(rid='R028', n=28, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\\\u201307/27)',\\n    who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='$24.00 per share, subject to an expedited diligence review; Party B also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement (formal signal).',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Light',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(563, 'Party B submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $24.00 per share (subject to an expedited diligence review).') + ' (P-016, p.29); mark-ups: ' + q(562, 'Party B, G&W and another bidder (\\\\u201cParty D\\\\u201d) also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement.') + ' (P-015, p.29). Convention: undated; window 07/20\\\\u201307/27 (the 07/27 meeting compared all six LOIs, P-023, p.30), working date = the 07/20 deadline (Assigned: deadline); order relative to G&W\\\\u2019s 07/21 LOI is not actually known (see R035). Formality Formal (returned agreement mark-ups); conditions Light (only an expedited diligence review attached).',\\n    src='P-015; P-016; P-023', link='P-016', review='Q2; Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=24.00, phigh=24.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: confirmatory; DD open: yes; Excl: none', page=29,\\n    related='R037; R050; R053', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R029', n=29, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\\\u201307/27)',\\n    who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='$21.26 per share, subject to a 60-day exclusivity period for due diligence and negotiation of definitive documentation. Party E provided a summary of material issues and proposed changes instead of agreement mark-ups.',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(565, 'Party E (a strategic buyer) submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $21.26 per share (subject to a 60-day exclusivity period for due diligence and negotiation of definitive documentation).') + ' (P-018, p.30); ' + q(562, 'One bidder (\\\\u201cParty E\\\\u201d) provided a summary of material issues and proposed changes to the merger agreement and voting agreement with respect to those issues.') + ' (P-015, p.29). Formality Informal (issue summary is not a returned agreement markup and no other formal signal); conditions Heavy (stated 60-day exclusive diligence/negotiation period).',\\n    src='P-015; P-018', link='P-018', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=21.26, phigh=21.26, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (60 days); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (60 days)', page=30,\\n    related='R037; R046; R047', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R030', n=30, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\\\u201307/27)',\\n    who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='$21.00 per share, subject to a four-week diligence period; Party D also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement.',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(566, 'Party D (a financial buyer) submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $21.00 per share (subject to a four-week diligence period).') + ' (P-019, p.30); mark-ups (P-015, p.29). Formality Formal (returned agreement mark-ups); conditions Heavy (stated four-week diligence period).',\\n    src='P-015; P-019', link='P-019', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=21.00, phigh=21.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (4 wks); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\\n    related='R037; R039; R045', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R031', n=31, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\\\u201307/27)',\\n    who='Party C (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='$19.30 per share, subject to a 30-day diligence period (below its 07/12/2016 IOI of $21.00). Count 0 \\\\u2014 Party C\\\\u2019s first Round-2 bid is R025; this is a same-round subsequent submission.',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(567, 'Party C submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $19.30 per share (subject to a 30-day diligence period).') + ' (P-020, p.30). Formality Informal (no mark-up attributed to C; mark-up list names B, G&W, D \\\\u2014 P-015, p.29); conditions Heavy (stated 30-day diligence period).',\\n    src='P-015; P-020', link='P-020', review='Q6; Q7', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=19.30, phigh=19.30, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\\n    related='covers R025; R037; R038', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R032', n=32, when='Late July 2016 (undated; window 07/20\\\\u201307/27)',\\n    who='Party F (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='$19.20 per share, subject to a 30-day due diligence period. No mark-up attributed to Party F.',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(568, 'Party F (a strategic buyer) submitted an LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $19.20 per share (subject to a 30-day due diligence period).') + ' (P-021, p.30). Formality Informal (no mark-up attributed; mark-up list names B, G&W, D \\\\u2014 P-015, p.29); conditions Heavy (stated 30-day diligence period).',\\n    src='P-015; P-021', link='P-021', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,20), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Approximate window', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', plow=19.20, phigh=19.20, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\\n    related='R037; R041; R046 (financing support to E)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 33-34. Non-submitting LOI bidders\\nadd(rid='R033', n=33, when='By 07/20/2016 (election reported in late July; no date)',\\n    who='Unnamed strategic bidder that elected not to submit an LOI', what='Did not submit', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Stated non-submission: of the bidders in the LOI stage, one strategic buyer elected not to submit. Stage: Round 2. Reason not stated.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(569, 'One strategic buyer and one financial buyer elected not to submit an LOI.') + ' (P-022, p.30). Convention: election undated; working date = the 07/20 deadline (Assigned: deadline). The filing supplies the type split, so the two non-submitters are recorded separately. Overlap with the seven advanced bidders and with Party A is unresolved (Q3).',\\n    src='P-022', link='P-022', review='Q3; Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,7,20), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', decidedby='Bidder', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Stated', page=30,\\n    related='R021; R037; R042 (possible member)', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R034', n=34, when='By 07/20/2016 (election reported in late July; no date)',\\n    who='Unnamed financial bidder that elected not to submit an LOI', what='Did not submit', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='Stated non-submission: of the bidders in the LOI stage, one financial buyer elected not to submit. Stage: Round 2. Reason not stated.',\\n    why='Stated. Same quotation as R033 (P-022, p.30). Convention: election undated; working date = the 07/20 deadline (Assigned: deadline).',\\n    src='P-022', link='P-022', review='Q3; Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,7,20), wdate=D(2016,7,20),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: deadline', decidedby='Bidder', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Stated', page=30,\\n    related='R021; R037; R042 (possible member)', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 35-36. G&W LOIs\\nadd(rid='R035', n=35, when='07/21/2016', who='G&W (Genesee & Wyoming Inc.)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='$21.15 per share: $20.02 cash at closing plus $1.13 in the form of a contingent value right (CVR) based on the subsequent sale of the Company\\\\u2019s South Quay property; subject to a three-week exclusive diligence period. G&W provided a mark-up of the disclosure letter plus mark-ups of the merger agreement and voting agreement (P-015, p.29). All cash: Yes (the CVR is a contingent cash payment).',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(564, 'G&W submitted an LOI on July 21, 2016 to acquire the Company for a price of $21.15 per share (subject to a three-week exclusive diligence period). The price included $20.02 cash at closing and $1.13 in the form of a contingent value right, the value of which was based on the subsequent sale of the Company\\\\u2019s South Quay property (\\\\u201cCVR\\\\u201d). G&W also provided a mark-up of the disclosure letter.') + ' (P-017, p.29). Formality Formal (bidder-returned agreement mark-ups); conditions Heavy (stated three-week exclusive diligence period).',\\n    src='P-015; P-017', link='P-017', review='Q6; Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,21), dto=D(2016,7,21), wdate=D(2016,7,21),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=21.15, phigh=21.15, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Yes', cashclose=20.02, conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (3 wks); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (3 wks)', page=29,\\n    related='R036; R037', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R036', n=36, when='07/26/2016', who='G&W (Genesee & Wyoming Inc.)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Revised LOI: $22.15 per share (including $21.02 in cash and $1.13 CVR), submitted in response to GHF feedback that G&W\\\\u2019s price and CVR structure were not competitive. Count 0 \\\\u2014 same bidder and round as R035. Conditions reassessed: no change reported, so the three-week exclusive diligence condition is carried.',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(564, 'On July 26, 2016, in response to feedback from representatives of GHF indicating its price and CVR structure were not competitive, G&W submitted a revised LOI, which increased its offer to $22.15 per share (including $21.02 in cash and $1.13 CVR).') + ' (P-017, p.29).',\\n    src='P-017', link='P-017', review='Q6', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,7,26), dto=D(2016,7,26), wdate=D(2016,7,26),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=22.15, phigh=22.15, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Yes', cashclose=21.02, conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (3 wks); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (3 wks)', page=29,\\n    related='revises R035; further revised by R052', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 37. Round 3 opened / selection\\nadd(rid='R037', n=37, when='07/27/2016', who='Transaction Committee (after the regular quarterly Board meeting)',\\n    what='Round opened', proc=1, rnd='3',\\n    terms='Selection: the Committee concluded to proceed with confirmatory due diligence and negotiations with G&W and Party B because of their higher offers; GHF subsequently told the remaining bidders they were no longer involved. Round finality: Inferred final \\\\u2014 no finality words, but the target moved to definitive negotiation with selected bidders (confirmatory due diligence and completion of the merger agreement). Director Smith (GATX, 4.92% holder) recused.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(570, 'The Transaction Committee concluded that the Company should proceed with confirmatory due diligence and negotiations with G&W and Party B because of the higher offers made by each of G&W and Party B relative to the other potential buyers. At the direction of the Transaction Committee, representatives of GHF subsequently contacted the remaining bidders to inform them that they were no longer involved in the process.') + ' (P-023, p.30).',\\n    src='P-023', link='P-023', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,7,27), dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,27),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', rfinal='Inferred final', page=30, related='R020; R021; R038\\\\u2013R042', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 38-41. Dropped C, D, E, F\\nfor rid, nm, typ, rnd in [('R038','Party C','Strategic','2'), ('R039','Party D','Financial','2'),\\n                          ('R040','Party E','Strategic','2'), ('R041','Party F','Strategic','2')]:\\n    add(rid=rid, n=38+['R038','R039','R040','R041'].index(rid), when='07/27/2016 (notice given subsequently)',\\n        who=nm, what='Dropped by target', proc=1, rnd=rnd, typ=typ,\\n        terms='Told it was no longer involved after the 07/27/2016 selection of G&W and Party B (stated comparative reason: the two continuing bids were higher). Stage left: Round 2.',\\n        why='Stated (notice). ' + q(570, 'representatives of GHF subsequently contacted the remaining bidders to inform them that they were no longer involved in the process.') + ' (P-023, p.30). Convention: notice undated; working date = the decision day (Assigned: decision day).',\\n        src='P-023', link='P-023', review='Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,27),\\n        dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: decision day', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Lower offer than rivals', obasis='Stated',\\n        page=30, related='R037', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 42. Party A identity row\\nadd(rid='R042', n=42, when='By 07/27/2016', who='Party A', what='Dropped by target', proc=1, rnd='2', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Inferred: identity \\\\u2014 Party A is not named in the 07/27/2016 continuing set (G&W and Party B) or in any later event. Could already be counted within: R019 (16 non-submitters at the 05/19 IOI deadline \\\\u2014 recommended reading: no Party A bid is reported and its last named activity precedes the IOI solicitation), R020 (two excluded low bidders) or R033/R034 (the two non-submitting LOI bidders). Count 0 \\\\u2014 no new bidder unit; no cohort count is moved to a name.',\\n    why='Inferred: identity. Premises: Party A is last named in April 2016 (P-009, p.28, memorandum recipients) and never again; the first identified continuing set that excludes it is ' + q(570, 'G&W and Party B') + ' (P-023, p.30). The filing does not identify which anonymous exit was Party A\\\\u2019s own.',\\n    src='P-006; P-009; P-023', link='P-023', review='Q3; Q5', count=0, dto=D(2016,7,27), wdate=D(2016,7,27),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: decision day', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: identity',\\n    page=30, related='R019; R020; R033; R034', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 43-44. Re-entries\\nfor rid, nm, typ, old in [('R043','Party D','Financial','R039'), ('R044','Party E','Strategic','R040')]:\\n    add(rid=rid, n=43+['R043','R044'].index(rid), when='07/29/2016', who=nm, what='Re-entered', proc=1, rnd='3', typ=typ,\\n        terms='GHF calls; ' + nm.split()[1] + ' expressed interest in reengaging and enhancing its offer \\\\u2014 renewed participation after the 07/27/2016 drop (see ' + old + '); revised LOI followed on 08/01/2016.',\\n        why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'On July 29, 2016, representatives of GHF had calls with Party D and Party E. During those calls, Party D and Party E both expressed interest in reengaging and enhancing their offers.') + ' (P-024, p.30).',\\n        src='P-024', link='P-024', review='Q7', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,7,29), dto=D(2016,7,29), wdate=D(2016,7,29),\\n        dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=30, related=old + '; R045/R046'.replace('R045/R046','R045' if old=='R039' else 'R046'), deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 45. Party D revised LOI\\nadd(rid='R045', n=45, when='08/01/2016', who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='Revised LOI: $24.00 per share, with a 30-day due diligence period; D also requested that the Company commit not to sign with another bidder during that period (request reported and declined on 08/02, R048). Formal documentation carried from its July mark-ups.',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'On August 1, 2016, Party D submitted a revised LOI at a price of $24.00 per share and Party E submitted a revised LOI, along with financing support, from Party F, at a price of $23.81 per share. Both revised proposals contained a 30-day due diligence period.') + ' (P-024, p.30). Formal carried (July mark-ups, P-015, p.29); Heavy (30-day diligence); exclusivity-like no-sign request: ' + q(571, 'Party D declined to shorten its due diligence period and requested that the Company commit that it would not enter into an agreement with another bidder during its 30-day due diligence period.') + ' (P-024, p.30).',\\n    src='P-015; P-024', link='P-024', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,1), dto=D(2016,8,1), wdate=D(2016,8,1),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=24.00, phigh=24.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (30 days)', page=30,\\n    related='revises R030; R043; R048', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 46. Party E revised LOI with F support\\nadd(rid='R046', n=46, when='08/01/2016', who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Support: Party F (financing) \\\\u2014 revised LOI at $23.81 per share with a 30-day due diligence period, submitted along with financing support from Party F. Related rows point to Party F\\\\u2019s earlier independent bid (R032); F had already exited on 07/27/2016 (R041), so it gets no new row and no Re-entered (support is not a bidding-group change).',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'Party E submitted a revised LOI, along with financing support, from Party F, at a price of $23.81 per share. Both revised proposals contained a 30-day due diligence period.') + ' (P-024, p.30). Formality Informal (E\\\\u2019s issues summary only; no mark-up reported for E). Conditions Heavy (30-day diligence); financing support represented but commitment level not stated.',\\n    src='P-024; P-032', link='P-024', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,1), dto=D(2016,8,1), wdate=D(2016,8,1),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=23.81, phigh=23.81, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: represented; DD required: substantive (30 days); DD open: yes; Excl: not stated', page=30,\\n    related='revises R029; R032 (Party F prior bid); R044; R047', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 47. Party E reversion\\nadd(rid='R047', n=47, when='08/02/2016', who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Bid reversion \\\\u2014 withdrew its revised $23.81 proposal and confirmed its original $21.26 per-share proposal (with its 60-day exclusivity condition). A withdrawal of the higher proposal while confirming the older one is a reversion, not a process withdrawal.',\\n    formality='Informal', cond='Heavy',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'Party E withdrew its revised proposal on August 2, 2016 (but confirmed its original proposal of $21.26 per share)') + ' (P-024, p.30). Convention: price carried forward from R029 (not restated); conditions reassessed from the confirmed original (60-day exclusive diligence/negotiation period).',\\n    src='P-024; P-018', link='P-024', review='Q6', count=0, dfrom=D(2016,8,2), dto=D(2016,8,2), wdate=D(2016,8,2),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=21.26, phigh=21.26, pkind='Point', porigin='Carried forward', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: substantive (60 days); DD open: yes; Excl: requested (60 days)', page=30,\\n    related='withdraws R046; reverts to R029; closed by R055', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 48. Party D paused\\nadd(rid='R048', n=48, when='08/02/2016', who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Participation paused', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='D declined to shorten its 30-day diligence period and requested that the Company commit not to sign with another bidder during it; the Company declined (given the active interest of Party B and G&W); D then indicated it would not proceed with further due diligence \\\\u201cat that time\\\\u201d. Treated as the bidder\\\\u2019s own stated temporary stop (a pause is not an exit); closed at signing (R054).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(571, 'Party D declined to shorten its due diligence period and requested that the Company commit that it would not enter into an agreement with another bidder during its 30-day due diligence period. In light of the active interest of Party B and G&W, the Company declined to make such a commitment, at which point Party D indicated that it would not proceed with further due diligence at that time.') + ' (P-024, p.30).',\\n    src='P-024', link='P-024', review='Q5; Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,2), dto=D(2016,8,2), wdate=D(2016,8,2),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', decidedby='Bidder', exitreason='Terms or process', obasis='Stated', page=30,\\n    related='see R045; closed by R054', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 49. Aug 4 TC decision\\nadd(rid='R049', n=49, when='08/04/2016', who='Transaction Committee', what='Target decision', proc=1, rnd='3',\\n    terms='Preferred-bidder decision: continue diligence and negotiations with both G&W and Party B, but given Party B\\\\u2019s higher price, prioritize Party B and complete the merger-agreement negotiation with Party B. Contemporaneous on-site diligence by both bidders ran 07/27\\\\u201308/11/2016.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(573, 'the Transaction Committee directed the management team and representatives of each of BMO and Hinckley Allen to continue diligence and negotiations with both G&W and Party B, but given the higher price offered by Party B, to prioritize Party B and proceed to complete the negotiation of the merger agreement with Party B.') + ' (P-026, p.31).',\\n    src='P-026', link='P-026', review='Q1', dfrom=D(2016,8,4), dto=D(2016,8,4), wdate=D(2016,8,4),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=31, related='R050; R051', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 50. Party B late reconfirmation\\nadd(rid='R050', n=50, when='08/04/2016', who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Bid reaffirmed', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Reaffirmed by: returned draft \\\\u2014 Party B\\\\u2019s legal counsel provided a revised merger agreement draft; $24.00 carried forward (not restated). Flagged for review (late reconfirmation).',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Light',\\n    why='Late reconfirmation per the three-part test. (a) Target moved to finalize with B: ' + q(573, 'to prioritize Party B and proceed to complete the negotiation of the merger agreement with Party B') + ' (P-026, p.31). (b) B\\\\u2019s latest priced row (R028) sits in Round 2 (Not final). (c) Bidder-side act: ' + q(574, 'On August 4, 2016, legal counsel for Party B provided a revised draft of the merger agreement') + ' (P-027, p.31). $24.00 carried forward; Formal (returned draft, signal 1); Light (only an expedited diligence review attached); DD open: yes (on-site diligence ran 07/27\\\\u201308/11, P-026, p.31).',\\n    src='P-026; P-027; P-016', link='P-027', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,4), dto=D(2016,8,4), wdate=D(2016,8,4),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=24.00, phigh=24.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Carried forward', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Not stated', conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: confirmatory; DD open: yes; Excl: none', page=31,\\n    related='reaffirms R028; R049; superseded by R053', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 51. Aug 9 G&W warning\\nadd(rid='R051', n=51, when='08/09/2016', who='Transaction Committee / BMO; G&W', what='Material process update', proc=1, rnd='3',\\n    terms='Committee directed BMO to inform G&W that the Company intended to enter a merger agreement with another bidder; G&W requested to continue its due diligence (including physical diligence on 08/10 and 08/11) to potentially facilitate an improved offer, which was granted. Consequential for the outcome: G&W then improved to $25.00 (R052).',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(574, 'the Transaction Committee directed representatives of BMO to inform G&W that the Company intended to enter into a merger agreement with another bidder. G&W requested that it be allowed to continue its due diligence, including physical due diligence on August 10 and August 11, 2016, to potentially facilitate an improved offer, which request was granted.') + ' (P-027, p.31).',\\n    src='P-027', link='P-027', dfrom=D(2016,8,9), dto=D(2016,8,9), wdate=D(2016,8,9),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=31, related='R052', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 52. G&W final bid\\nadd(rid='R052', n=52, when='08/12/2016', who='G&W (Genesee & Wyoming Inc.)', what='Bid', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Revised LOI: $25.00 per share in cash; previously proposed CVR excluded; mark-ups of the merger agreement and voting agreement; offer to expire at 6:00 p.m. on the following day (08/13/2016). Submitted after BMO told G&W the Company intended to sign with another bidder (R051).',\\n    formality='Formal', cond='Light',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(575, 'G&W submitted a revised LOI to acquire the Company for a price of $25.00 per share in cash, which excluded the previously proposed CVR, together with mark-ups of the merger agreement and the voting agreement. G&W\\\\u2019s LOI further indicated that the offer would expire at 6:00 p.m. on the following day.') + ' (P-028, p.31). Formality Formal (returned mark-ups and price set during definitive negotiation); conditions Light (no diligence condition attached; physical diligence completed 08/11, P-027, p.31; priced all in cash).',\\n    src='P-027; P-028', link='P-028', review='Q6', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,12), dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', plow=25.00, phigh=25.00, pkind='Point', porigin='Stated', ccy='USD',\\n    allcash='Yes', cashclose=25.00, conddetail='Fin: not stated; DD required: none; DD open: no; Excl: none', page=31,\\n    related='revises R036; supersedes R050/R035; closed by R056', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 53. Party B not selected\\nadd(rid='R053', n=53, when='08/12/2016', who='Party B (potential strategic buyer)', what='Not selected at signing', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Still bidding when the Board chose G&W: at the Board\\\\u2019s request BMO asked Party B whether it would increase its price and Party B declined. Exit reason: Would not improve earlier offer (asked to improve and declined); agency remains with the target\\\\u2019s selection.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(579, 'At the request of the Board, representatives of BMO then contacted Party B to determine if it would increase its offer price. Party B indicated that it would not increase its price.') + ' ... ' + q(579, 'The Board determined that the G&W offer represented the superior proposal.') + ' (P-032, p.32).',\\n    src='P-032', link='P-032', review='Q5', count=1, dfrom=D(2016,8,12), dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', decidedby='Target', exitreason='Would not improve earlier offer', obasis='Stated',\\n    page=32, related='R050; R056', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 54-55. Inferred closes at signing\\nadd(rid='R054', n=54, when='By 08/12/2016', who='Party D (financial buyer)', what='Not selected at signing', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Financial',\\n    terms='Inferred: silent \\\\u2014 last reported activity was D\\\\u2019s 08/02/2016 pause (R048); the filing never mentions D again; closed at signing as a bidder still live in the process. No notice to D is reported; no invented motive or exit.',\\n    why='Inferred: silent. Last appearance: ' + q(571, 'Party D indicated that it would not proceed with further due diligence at that time') + ' (P-024, p.30); the next identified transition is the 08/12/2016 signing (P-033, p.32), with only G&W named as acquirer. Closing convention (section 10.2).',\\n    src='P-024; P-033', link='P-033', review='Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: bound', decidedby='Unknown', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: silent',\\n    page=32, related='R048; R056', deal=DEAL)\\nadd(rid='R055', n=55, when='By 08/12/2016', who='Party E (strategic buyer)', what='Not selected at signing', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Inferred: silent \\\\u2014 last reported activity was E\\\\u2019s 08/02/2016 reversion to its $21.26 proposal (R047); the filing never mentions E again; closed at signing as a bidder still live in the process. No notice to E is reported.',\\n    why='Inferred: silent. Last appearance: ' + q(571, 'Party E withdrew its revised proposal on August 2, 2016 (but confirmed its original proposal of $21.26 per share)') + ' (P-024, p.30); the next identified transition is the 08/12/2016 signing (P-033, p.32), with only G&W named as acquirer. Closing convention (section 10.2).',\\n    src='P-024; P-033', link='P-033', review='Q5', count=1, dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\\n    dbasis='Relative only', dmethod='Assigned: bound', decidedby='Unknown', exitreason='Not stated', obasis='Inferred: silent',\\n    page=32, related='R047; R056', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 56. Signing\\nadd(rid='R056', n=56, when='08/12/2016', who='Company and G&W (Pullman Acquisition Sub Inc.)', what='Merger agreement signed', proc=1, rnd='3', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Agreed consideration: $25.00 in cash per share of common stock; each preferred share deemed converted (100-for-1) into 100 common shares plus accrued/unpaid dividends (X-008, p.50); Merger Sub merges into the Company (surviving as a G&W subsidiary); Eder Trusts voting agreement executed (482,742? no\\\\u2014842,742 common / 500 preferred; X-013, p.72); termination fee $3,785,000 (~3% of transaction value; G&W\\\\u2019s draft reduced from 3.85%) (X-010, p.55); outside date 12/31/2016, or 02/28/2017 if only STB approval remains (X-016, p.8); no go-shop \\\\u2014 non-solicitation with fiduciary out and matching rights. Board approved (Director Smith recused) after BMO\\\\u2019s oral fairness opinion, confirmed in writing 08/12/2016 (P-032, p.32). Signing is not a new bid: price/formality cells left blank.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(580, 'Shortly thereafter, Hinckley Allen and Simpson Thacher finalized the transaction documents and the Company and G&W executed the merger agreement, and the Company, G&W and the Eder Trusts executed the voting agreement.') + ' (P-033, p.32). Consideration and terms per X-008; X-010; X-013; X-016.',\\n    src='P-032; P-033; X-008; X-010; X-013; X-016', link='P-033', review='Q8', dfrom=D(2016,8,12), dto=D(2016,8,12), wdate=D(2016,8,12),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=32, related='R052; R053; R057', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 57. Announcement\\nadd(rid='R057', n=57, when='08/15/2016', who='Company (issuer) / G&W', what='Merger announced', proc=1, rnd='post', typ='Strategic',\\n    terms='Press release publicly announced the transaction before the opening of NASDAQ trading on Monday, 08/15/2016.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(580, 'The Company issued a press release publicly announcing the transaction on Monday, August 15, 2016 prior to the opening of trading of the Company\\\\u2019s common stock on the NASDAQ.') + ' (P-033, p.32).',\\n    src='P-033', link='P-033', count=None, dfrom=D(2016,8,15), dto=D(2016,8,15), wdate=D(2016,8,15),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=32, related='R056', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# 58. BMO conflict update\\nadd(rid='R058', n=58, when='09/06/2016', who='Board of Directors / BMO Capital Markets Corp.', what='Material process update', proc=1, rnd='post',\\n    terms='Post-signing: the Board considered BMO\\\\u2019s report that it had inadvertently failed to identify a BMO affiliate\\\\u2019s participation in G&W\\\\u2019s existing secured syndicated debt facility (approximately 5% of the syndicate; revenue of $1\\\\u2013$5 million since 01/01/2014; X-006/X-007, p.41\\\\u201342); the Board determined the relationship was not material to BMO\\\\u2019s independence and confirmed continued comfort with BMO\\\\u2019s engagement and opinion.',\\n    why='Stated. ' + q(581, 'representatives of BMO advised the Board that when checking to determine if there were any financial advisory or financing relationships with G&W, it had inadvertently failed to identify that a BMO affiliate has a participation in G&W\\\\u2019s existing secured syndicated debt facility') + ' ... ' + q(581, 'On September 6, 2016, the Board considered this new information, determined this relationship was not material to BMO\\\\u2019s independence and confirmed that the Board remained comfortable with the engagement and opinion of BMO.') + ' (P-034, p.32); facility detail X-007, p.42.',\\n    src='P-034; X-006; X-007', link='P-034', dfrom=D(2016,9,6), dto=D(2016,9,6), wdate=D(2016,9,6),\\n    dbasis='Reported day', dmethod='Reported', page=32, related='R002; R056', deal=DEAL)\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# BUILD WORKBOOK\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nwb = Workbook()\\n\\nVISIBLE = ['Deal ledger','Summary','Questions','Source text']\\nws_led = wb.active; ws_led.title = 'Deal ledger'\\nws_sum = wb.create_sheet('Summary')\\nws_que = wb.create_sheet('Questions')\\nws_src = wb.create_sheet('Source text')\\nws_orig = wb.create_sheet('AI original')\\nws_lists = wb.create_sheet('Lists')\\nws_orig.sheet_state = 'hidden'\\nws_lists.sheet_state = 'hidden'\\n\\nHDR_FILL = PatternFill('solid', fgColor='1F3864')\\nHDR_FONT = Font(bold=True, color='FFFFFF', size=9)\\nGRP_FILL = PatternFill('solid', fgColor='D9E1F2')\\nBOLD = Font(bold=True)\\nWRAP = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top')\\nWRAP_C = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top', horizontal='center')\\n\\nLEDGER_HEADERS = ['#','When','Who','What happened','Process','Round','Type','Terms or outcome','Formality',\\n 'Conditions level','Why and evidence','Source','Review','Reviewer note']\\nEXP_HEADERS = ['Row id','Include','Count','Date from','Date to','Working date','Date basis','Date method',\\n 'Price low','Price high','Price kind','Price origin','Currency','All cash','Cash at closing','Conditions detail',\\n 'Due date','Deadline treatment','Round finality','Decided by','Exit reason','Outcome basis','Page','Related rows','Deal']\\nALL_HEADERS = LEDGER_HEADERS + EXP_HEADERS\\nNCOL = len(ALL_HEADERS)\\n\\ndef write_header(ws, headers, row=1):\\n    for c, h in enumerate(headers, start=1):\\n        cell = ws.cell(row=row, column=c, value=h)\\n        cell.fill = HDR_FILL; cell.font = HDR_FONT\\n        cell.alignment = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='center', horizontal='center')\\n    ws.row_dimensions[row].height = 30\\n\\nwrite_header(ws_led, ALL_HEADERS)\\n\\ndef put(ws, r, c, v, fmt=None):\\n    cell = ws.cell(row=r, column=c, value=v)\\n    cell.alignment = WRAP\\n    if fmt: cell.number_format = fmt\\n    return cell\\n\\nFIELD_ORDER = ['n','when','who','what','proc','rnd','typ','terms','formality','cond','why','src','review','reviewer','rid','include','count','dfrom','dto','wdate','dbasis','dmethod','plow','phigh','pkind','porigin','ccy','allcash','cashclose','conddetail','duedate','dtreat','rfinal','decidedby','exitreason','obasis','page','related','deal']\\n\\n# source ids -> source sheet row number (will be set after writing source sheet; compute now: header at row 1, P rows start 2)\\nSRC_ROW = {}\\nfor i, (pid, sec, p, t) in enumerate(P_ROWS):\\n    SRC_ROW[pid] = 2 + i\\nfor i, (pid, sec, p, t) in enumerate(X_ROWS):\\n    SRC_ROW[pid] = 2 + len(P_ROWS) + i\\n\\nLEDGER_LAST = 1 + len(ROWS)\\nfor r, row in enumerate(ROWS, start=2):\\n    row.setdefault('include', 'Yes')\\n    for c, f in enumerate(FIELD_ORDER, start=1):\\n        v = row.get(f)\\n        if f in ('dfrom','dto','wdate','duedate') and v is not None:\\n            cell = put(ws_led, r, c, v, 'mm/dd/yyyy')\\n        elif f in ('plow','phigh','cashclose') and v is not None:\\n            cell = put(ws_led, r, c, v, '#,##0.00')\\n        else:\\n            cell = put(ws_led, r, c, v)\\n    # hyperlink on Source column (col 12)\\n    scell = ws_led.cell(row=r, column=12)\\n    main = row['link']\\n    scell.value = row['src']\\n    scell.hyperlink = Hyperlink(ref=scell.coordinate, location=f\\\"'Source text'!$A${SRC_ROW[main]}\\\", tooltip='main source paragraph')\\n    scell.font = Font(color='0563C1', underline='single')\\n    ws_led.row_dimensions[r].height = 88\\n\\n# widths\\nLEDGER_W = {'A':5,'B':20,'C':24,'D':17,'E':8,'F':7,'G':11,'H':52,'I':12,'J':11,'K':62,'L':22,'M':10,'N':12,\\n 'O':8,'P':8,'Q':7,'R':11,'S':11,'T':12,'U':14,'V':16,'W':9,'X':10,'Y':14,'Z':14,'AA':9,'AB':10,'AC':12,'AD':34,\\n 'AE':11,'AF':16,'AG':14,'AH':11,'AI':20,'AJ':16,'AK':6,'AL':26,'AM':10}\\nfor col, w in LEDGER_W.items():\\n    ws_led.column_dimensions[col].width = w\\n\\nws_led.freeze_panes = 'D2'\\nws_led.auto_filter.ref = f'A1:{get_column_letter(NCOL)}{LEDGER_LAST}'\\nws_led.sheet_view.zoomScale = 90\\n\\n# collapsed expandable groups (Row id+Include; Count; dates; prices; cash; conditions; deadlines; outcomes; page; related; deal)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('O','P', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('Q', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('R','V', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('W','AA', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AB','AC', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AD', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AE','AG', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AH','AJ', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AK', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AL', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.column_dimensions.group('AM', outline_level=1, hidden=True)\\nws_led.sheet_properties.outlinePr.summaryRight = False\\nws_led.sheet_properties.outlinePr.summaryBelow = True\\n\\n# ---- AI original (values copy of the ledger) ----\\nfor r in range(1, LEDGER_LAST+1):\\n    for c in range(1, NCOL+1):\\n        v = ws_led.cell(row=r, column=c).value\\n        ws_orig.cell(row=r, column=c, value=v)\\nfor col, w in LEDGER_W.items():\\n    ws_orig.column_dimensions[col].width = w\\nws_orig.freeze_panes = 'D2'\\n\\n# ---- Lists + data validation ----\\nLISTS = {\\n 'What happened': ['Target interest','Bidder interest','Target sale decision','Activist pressure','Activist involvement',\\n   'Adviser engaged','Adviser service observed','Adviser ended','Contact','NDA signed','Round opened','Deadline set',\\n   'Deadline revised','Deadline','Target decision','Information access changed','Material process update',\\n   'Exclusivity changed','Bid','Bid reaffirmed','Offer update','Other-scope bid','Valuation statement',\\n   'Bidding group changed','Joined group','Dropped by target','Withdrew','Did not submit','Participation paused',\\n   'Re-entered','Not selected at signing','Sale process announced','Bid announced','Merger announced',\\n   'Merger agreement signed','Go-shop changed','Process terminated','Process restarted','Agreement terminated','Closed'],\\n 'Type': ['Strategic','Financial','Mixed','Unknown'],\\n 'Formality': ['Formal','Informal','Insufficient evidence','Varies'],\\n 'Conditions level': ['None','Light','Heavy','Insufficient evidence','Varies'],\\n 'Include': ['Yes','No'],\\n 'Date basis': ['Reported day','Inferred day','Reported interval','Approximate window','Relative only','Undated'],\\n 'Date method': ['Reported','Inferred','Assigned: deadline','Assigned: decision day','Assigned: midpoint','Assigned: bound','Assigned: sequence'],\\n 'Price kind': ['Point','Bidder range','Group envelope','Bound only','Undisclosed'],\\n 'Price origin': ['Stated','Carried forward','Inferred'],\\n 'All cash': ['Yes','No','Not stated'],\\n 'Deadline treatment': ['Enforced','Extended','Late bids accepted','Passed without action','Unclear','No deadline stated'],\\n 'Round finality': ['Announced as final','Inferred final','Not final'],\\n 'Decided by': ['Bidder','Target','Both','Unknown'],\\n 'Exit reason': ['Value below market price','Value at or below market price','Value below earlier offer','Value at earlier offer',\\n   'Would not improve earlier offer','Lower offer than rivals','Terms or process','Other stated reason','Not stated'],\\n 'Outcome basis': ['Stated','Inferred: residual','Inferred: exclusivity','Inferred: silent','Inferred: identity'],\\n}\\nws_lists.cell(row=1, column=1, value='List')\\nfor j, (name, vals) in enumerate(LISTS.items(), start=1):\\n    col = get_column_letter(j)\\n    ws_lists.cell(row=1, column=j, value=name).font = BOLD\\n    for i, v in enumerate(vals, start=2):\\n        ws_lists.cell(row=i, column=j, value=v)\\n    ws_lists.column_dimensions[col].width = max(12, len(name)+2)\\n\\nVALID = [('D', 'What happened'), ('G','Type'), ('I','Formality'), ('J','Conditions level'), ('P','Include'),\\n         ('U','Date basis'), ('V','Date method'), ('Y','Price kind'), ('Z','Price origin'), ('AB','All cash'),\\n         ('AF','Deadline treatment'), ('AG','Round finality'), ('AH','Decided by'), ('AI','Exit reason'), ('AJ','Outcome basis')]\\nlist_col = {name: get_column_letter(j) for j, name in enumerate(LISTS, start=1)}\\nfor col, name in VALID:\\n    dv = DataValidation(type='list', formula1=f'Lists!${list_col[name]}$2:${list_col[name]}${len(LISTS[name])+1}',\\n                        allow_blank=True, showDropDown=False)\\n    dv.error = 'Use a value from the Lists sheet'; dv.errorTitle = 'Controlled category'\\n    ws_led.add_data_validation(dv)\\n    dv.add(f'{col}2:{col}{LEDGER_LAST}')\\n\\n# conditional highlight: changed vs AI original (red bold) and new rows\\ncf_range = f'B2:{get_column_letter(NCOL)}{LEDGER_LAST}'\\nchanged_formula = (f\\\"AND($A2<>\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",NOT(ISNA(MATCH($A2,'AI original'!$A$2:$A${LEDGER_LAST},0))),\\\"\\n                   f\\\"NOT(EXACT(B2&\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",INDEX('AI original'!$B$2:${get_column_letter(NCOL)}${LEDGER_LAST},\\\"\\n                   f\\\"MATCH($A2,'AI original'!$A$2:$A${LEDGER_LAST},0),COLUMN()-1)&\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\")))\\\")\\nnew_formula = f\\\"AND($A2<>\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",ISNA(MATCH($A2,'AI original'!$A$2:$A${LEDGER_LAST},0)))\\\"\\nws_led.conditional_formatting.add(cf_range, FormulaRule(formula=[changed_formula], font=Font(bold=True, color='C00000'), stopIfTrue=False))\\nws_led.conditional_formatting.add(cf_range, FormulaRule(formula=[new_formula], font=Font(bold=True, color='C00000'), stopIfTrue=False))\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# SOURCE TEXT SHEET\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nwrite_header(ws_src, ['Paragraph','Section','Page','Text'])\\nsr = 2\\nfor pid, sec, p, t in P_ROWS + X_ROWS:\\n    put(ws_src, sr, 1, pid); put(ws_src, sr, 2, sec)\\n    pc = put(ws_src, sr, 3, int(p) if p else None); pc.alignment = WRAP_C\\n    put(ws_src, sr, 4, t)\\n    sr += 1\\nws_src.column_dimensions['A'].width = 11\\nws_src.column_dimensions['B'].width = 48\\nws_src.column_dimensions['C'].width = 7\\nws_src.column_dimensions['D'].width = 140\\nws_src.freeze_panes = 'A2'\\nws_src.auto_filter.ref = f'A1:D{sr-1}'\\nfor r in range(2, sr):\\n    ws_src.row_dimensions[r].height = 60\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# SUMMARY SHEET\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\ndef S(row, a='', b='', bold_a=False, bold_b=False, wrap=True):\\n    ca = ws_sum.cell(row=row, column=1, value=a); ca.alignment = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top')\\n    cb = ws_sum.cell(row=row, column=2, value=b); cb.alignment = Alignment(wrap_text=True, vertical='top')\\n    if bold_a: ca.font = BOLD\\n    if bold_b: cb.font = BOLD\\n    return row+1\\n\\nr = 1\\nr = S(r, 'PWRR / GENESEE & WYOMING DEAL LEDGER \\\\u2014 SUMMARY', '', bold_a=True)\\nr = S(r, 'AI first pass; not human-approved.', 'Instruction revision: 19 September 2026 (Pro revision of 18 September 2026). Supplied-source coverage: one SEC filing used \\\\u2014 DEFM14A (definitive proxy statement), proxy dated September 19, 2016, filed 2016-09-20, file raw_filing/providence-worcester_2016-09-20_DEFM14A.htm (background pp.27\\\\u201332). No other source used. Last recheck status: initial build; all checks in this workbook were run on this version (see Questions \\\\u2013 Check results); content not yet rechecked after any human edit.')\\nr += 1\\nr = S(r, '1. STATUS AND COMMERCIAL ACCOUNT', '', bold_a=True)\\nr = S(r, 'Commercial account', 'Party A\\\\u2019s fourth-quarter 2015 expression of interest in acquiring equity in Providence & Worcester Railroad prompted the Board to engage GHF and, on 03/14/2016, to authorize a broad solicitation of strategic and financial buyers (29 contacted in the week of 03/28/2016; 25 executed confidentiality agreements, plus Party C in July). Nine non-binding IOIs ($17.93\\\\u2013$26.50 per share) arrived 05/19\\\\u201306/01/2016; the two lowest were excluded and seven bidders advanced on 06/01/2016 to management presentations and a 07/20/2016 LOI round (six LOIs, $19.20\\\\u2013$24.00). On 07/27/2016 the committee selected G&W and Party B for confirmatory diligence and definitive negotiation. G&W\\\\u2019s July bids carried a $1.13/share CVR tied to the South Quay property and asked for a three-week exclusive diligence period; its 07/26 revision raised the price to $22.15, while Party B led at $24.00. After Party B declined to improve on 08/12/2016, G&W submitted a final $25.00 all-cash revised LOI (CVR dropped) with merger-agreement mark-ups and an offer expiry of 6:00 p.m. on 08/13/2016; the Board approved and the parties signed the merger agreement the same day, announcing it on 08/15/2016. Observed outcome: signed merger agreement; no post-signing competing proposal appears in the proxy; closing is not observed (expected Q4 2016).')\\nr = S(r, 'Initiation assessment', 'Mixed \\\\u2014 bidder-led trigger (Party A\\\\u2019s Q4 2015 unpriced approach) followed by a target-directed broad sale process led by the Board and Transaction Committee. Sequence and evidence: R001\\\\u2013R006.')\\nr += 1\\nr = S(r, '2. DEAL FACTS', '', bold_a=True)\\nr = S(r, 'Target', 'Providence and Worcester Railroad Company (PWRR), a Rhode Island corporation; regional freight railroad; NASDAQ: PWX. 4,866,593 common shares and 640 preferred shares outstanding as of the 09/16/2016 record date; preferred is non-listed and converts 100-for-1.')\\nr = S(r, 'Focal acquirer and type', 'Genesee & Wyoming Inc. (G&W), a Delaware corporation, NYSE: GWR \\\\u2014 Strategic (operating short-line/regional freight railroad group; X-014, p.21). Acquired through Pullman Acquisition Sub Inc., formed 08/12/2016 solely for the merger (P-002 area; R056).')\\nr = S(r, 'Agreed consideration', '$25.00 in cash per share of common stock. Each preferred share is deemed converted (100-for-1) into 100 common shares plus accrued/unpaid dividends, so its holder receives $25.00 per converted share (X-008, p.50). No financing condition (X-003, p.34); termination fee $3,785,000 (~3% of transaction value); non-solicitation with a fiduciary out; no go-shop (X-010, p.55).')\\nr = S(r, 'Signing / announcement / completion', 'Signed 08/12/2016; announced 08/15/2016 before the NASDAQ open (R056, R057); expected closing Q4 2016, not observed; outside date 12/31/2016 (02/28/2017 if only STB approval remains) (X-016, p.8).')\\nr = S(r, 'Filing', 'DEFM14A proxy statement dated September 19, 2016 (filed 2016-09-20 per filename); source file: raw_filing/providence-worcester_2016-09-20_DEFM14A.htm; background pp.27\\\\u201332.')\\nr = S(r, 'Market benchmarks', 'Closing price $16.30 on 08/12/2016 (last trading day before announcement; the $25.00 consideration represents a 53% premium per the Reasons section) and $24.88 on 09/16/2016 (X-004, p.11; X-002, p.33). Q3 2016 trading high $25.00 (p.71).')\\nr += 1\\nr = S(r, '3. PROCESS AND ROUND MAP', '', bold_a=True)\\nr = S(r, 'Process count', 'One process (Process 1). The sale attempt ran continuously from Party A\\\\u2019s Q4 2015 approach through signing on 08/12/2016; no abandonment, dormancy or restart is reported, so no second process. Round 0 holds the pre-opening inbound approach and preparation.')\\nr = S(r, 'Round 0 (pre-opening)', 'Q4 2015\\\\u201303/27/2016: Party A approach (R001); GHF engagement (R002); Board sale decision (R003); Party A management meeting (R004); Transaction Committee authorization (R005). No Round opened row for round 0 by convention.')\\nr = S(r, 'Round 1', 'Anchor: first outreach wave, week of 03/28/2016 (R006) \\\\u2014 GHF contacted 11 potential strategic buyers and 18 potential financial buyers; IOI deadline set 04/27/2016 for 05/10/2016, revised to 05/19/2016 (R015\\\\u2013R017). Nine IOIs ($17.93\\\\u2013$26.50 envelope) received 05/19\\\\u201306/01 (R018). Objective: non-binding IOIs. Finality: Not final. Round-bidder tally: 9 (formula in section 5).')\\nr = S(r, 'Round 2', 'Opened 06/01/2016 (R021): seven of nine IOI bidders advanced to management presentations and data-site diligence; Party C entered as a late entrant (R023\\\\u2013R026); all buyers instructed mid-June to submit LOIs plus mark-ups by 07/20/2016 (R022, R027); six LOIs received late July (R028\\\\u2013R036). Objective: presentations/diligence then non-binding LOIs. Finality: Not final. Round-bidder tally: 6 (B, G&W, C, D, E, F).')\\nr = S(r, 'Round 3', 'Opened 07/27/2016 (R037): selection of G&W and Party B for confirmatory diligence and definitive negotiation; remaining bidders dropped (R038\\\\u2013R041); D and E re-entered 07/29 (R043\\\\u2013R044) and revised their LOIs 08/01 with outcomes 08/02 (R045\\\\u2013R048); Aug 4 prioritization of Party B (R049) and Party B\\\\u2019s late reconfirmation (R050); G&W warning and improved bid (R051\\\\u2013R052); signing 08/12 (R056). Finality: Inferred final (moved to definitive negotiation with selected bidders). Round-bidder tally: 4 (G&W, B, D, E).')\\nr = S(r, 'Post-signing', '08/12/2016 onward: announcement 08/15 (R057); BMO conflict recheck 09/06 (R058); STB petition filed 09/01/2016 and voting-trust agreement submitted 09/14/2016 (X-011/X-012, p.64\\\\u201365). No go-shop; no post-signing competing proposal observed in the proxy; closing not observed.')\\nr = S(r, 'Deadline map', '05/10/2016 (set 04/27/2016): Extended \\\\u2014 postponed to 05/19/2016 (R015\\\\u2013R016). 05/19/2016 (IOI due): Enforced \\\\u2014 nine IOIs reviewed and process advanced 06/01; the 05/19\\\\u201306/01 receipt window straddles the date and no arrival is dated after it (R017; alternative reading in Q2). 07/20/2016 (LOI/mark-up due): Late bids accepted \\\\u2014 G&W\\\\u2019s 07/21 LOI was reviewed with the others and advanced (R027).')\\nr += 1\\nr = S(r, '4. PARTICIPANTS AND ADVISERS', '', bold_a=True)\\nr = S(r, 'Named bidders', 'Party A \\\\u2014 Strategic (Class I rail partner); unpriced Q4 2015 approach; last named April 2016; closed by Count-0 identity row R042 (Inferred: identity). G&W \\\\u2014 Strategic; winner; bids R035, R036, R052; signed R056 (no exit row). Party B \\\\u2014 Strategic; $24.00 LOI R028 and late reaffirmation R050; Not selected at signing R053 (Would not improve earlier offer). Party C \\\\u2014 Strategic late entrant; IOI $21.00 R025, LOI $19.30 R031; Dropped R038. Party D \\\\u2014 Financial; LOI $21.00 R030, revised $24.00 R045; paused R048; closed by inferred R054. Party E \\\\u2014 Strategic; LOI $21.26 R029, revised $23.81 with Party F support R046, reverted to $21.26 R047; closed by inferred R055. Party F \\\\u2014 Strategic; LOI $19.20 R032; Dropped R041; later gave financing support to E (no membership change).')\\nr = S(r, 'Cohorts (not extra parties)', '11 strategic NDA signers (R009); 14 financial NDA signers (R010); nine IOI bidders, type Unknown (R018); two excluded low bidders, Unknown (R020); 16 non-submitting signers, Unknown (R019); two non-submitting LOI bidders, split strategic/financial (R033\\\\u2013R034). Two additional Class I railroads were contacted but never entered (R013).')\\nr = S(r, 'Ownership / country attributes', 'PWRR is US (Rhode Island); G&W is US (Delaware). Eder Trusts hold 842,742 common shares (17.3%) and 500 preferred (78.1%); directors/officers hold ~22.7% of common and ~78.1% of preferred (X-013, p.72). Director Alfred P. Smith (GATX VP; GATX owns 4.92% of common) recused from the process (P-023, p.30).')\\nr = S(r, 'Advisers', 'GHF / BMO Capital Markets Corp. \\\\u2014 Company financial adviser; GHF engaged 01/27/2016 (R002); BMO acquired GHF\\\\u2019s business 08/01/2016 (one continuing relationship); fee ~$2.52 million; BMO affiliate ~5% lender in G&W\\\\u2019s syndicated facility, reviewed 09/06/2016 (R058). Hinckley, Allen & Snyder LLP \\\\u2014 Company legal counsel (first observed 03/24/2016, R005). Simpson Thacher & Bartlett LLP \\\\u2014 G&W legal counsel (first observed 08/10/2016, P-027). Company STB counsel \\\\u2014 not named. G&W financial adviser \\\\u2014 not disclosed.')\\nr += 1\\nr = S(r, '5. COUNTS AND AUCTION SCREEN', '', bold_a=True)\\ndef fcount(row_label, note, formula):\\n    global r\\n    r = S(r, row_label, note)\\n    c = ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value=formula); c.alignment = Alignment(vertical='top')\\nr = S(r, 'Contact tally (ledger formula)', '=SUMIFS(\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$Q:$Q,\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$D:$D,\\\"Contact\\\",\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$P:$P,\\\"Yes\\\") \\\\u2014 33 contact-count units: 29 initial wave (R007+R008) + 2 additional Class I railroads (R013) + Party A first contact (R001) + Party C inbound (R023). Party B\\\\u2019s contact (R014) carries no Count because its membership in the wave cohort is not disclosed. Distinct prospective buyers contacted: 32 (Party A is counted once inside the 29 and again only as the earlier first contact).')\\nr = S(r, 'NDA tally (ledger formula)', '=SUMIFS(\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$Q:$Q,\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$D:$D,\\\"NDA signed\\\",\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$P:$P,\\\"Yes\\\") \\\\u2014 26 signer events: 11 strategic (R009) + 14 financial (R010) + Party C (R024). Filing assertion: the Reasons section states 25 confidentiality agreements (X-001, p.33). Reconciliation: the narrative\\\\u2019s 11 + 14 = 25 is the March\\\\u2013April wave; Party C executed its agreement in early July after approaching the Company (R023\\\\u2013R024). 26 \\\\u2212 25 = 1 = Party C; unresolved whether the Reasons\\\\u2019 25 includes or excludes Party C (Q3).')\\nr = S(r, 'Round-bidder tallies (formulas)', 'Round 1: =SUMIFS(\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$Q:$Q,\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$F:$F,\\\"1\\\",\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$D:$D,\\\"Bid\\\",\\\\'Deal ledger\\\\'!$P:$P,\\\"Yes\\\") = 9 (R018 envelope cohort). Round 2: same with Round \\\"2\\\" plus \\\"Bid reaffirmed\\\" = 6 (B R028, E R029, D R030, C R025 at Count 1, F R032, G&W R035). Round 3: Round \\\"3\\\" bids plus reaffirmation = 4 (D R045, E R046, B R050, G&W R052). These are stage-specific submitters, not unique firms.')\\nr = S(r, 'Per-stage balance', 'Round 1: 25 signers \\\\u2212 16 inferred non-submitters (R019) \\\\u2212 2 stated exclusions (R020) = 7 continuing (R021). Round 2: 7 continuing + 1 late entrant (Party C) = 8; \\\\u2212 2 stated non-submitters (R033\\\\u2013R034) \\\\u2212 4 stated drops (R038\\\\u2013R041) = 2 continuing (R037). Round 3: 2 + 2 re-entries (R043\\\\u2013R044) \\\\u2212 3 closures (R053\\\\u2013R055) = 1 winner (G&W). Inferred share of exits: 16 of 25 inferred (64%) in Round 1; 2 of 3 R3 closures inferred silent; no inferred identity was converted into a count (R042 Count 0).')\\nr = S(r, 'Outcome tallies (occurrences/units)', 'Dropped by target: 2 units (R020) + 4 units (R038\\\\u2013R041) + 1 Count-0 identity row (R042). Did not submit: 16 units (R019) + 2 units (R033\\\\u2013R034). Participation paused: 1 (R048). Re-entered: 2 (R043\\\\u2013R044). Not selected at signing: 3 (R053\\\\u2013R055). These are event units, not unique permanent exits.')\\nr = S(r, 'Auction screen', 'Met \\\\u2014 more than one independent prospective acquiring bidder unit executed bidder-target confidentiality agreements for this process (11 strategic + 14 financial signers in the current attempt, R009\\\\u2013R010, plus Party C, R024). No lender-only, adviser or rollover-holder agreements are counted. Sample eligibility remains a separate research decision.')\\nr += 1\\nr = S(r, '6. COMPARABILITY AND INPUTS', '', bold_a=True)\\nr = S(r, 'Unusual consideration / other scope', 'No Other-scope bids in this ledger: every priced proposal was for 100% of the equity. G&W\\\\u2019s July bids included a $1.13/share CVR (South Quay property sale, a contingent cash payment; dropped in the final bid). All-cash = Yes on G&W\\\\u2019s bids; consideration structures for the anonymous cohorts and other parties are not stated, so their all-cash flags are \\\\u201cNot stated\\\\u201d (no inference from bidder type).')\\nr = S(r, 'Share counts and conversion', '4,866,593 common; 640 preferred (100-for-1 conversion; non-cumulative dividend up to $5.00/share/year). Disclosed equity values in the filing ($90\\\\u2013$134 million; $96\\\\u2013$121 million; $108 million) assume preferred conversion and a 100% common-stock basis (P-011, P-012, P-014\\\\u2013P-016).')\\nr = S(r, 'Labelled conversion (optional)', 'Preferred consideration on the stated terms: 100 common shares per preferred share \\\\u00d7 $25.00 = $2,500 per preferred share, before accrued/unpaid dividends. This is a labelled arithmetic conversion of disclosed inputs (X-008, p.50), not an observed bid or market price.')\\nr = S(r, 'Market benchmarks', '$16.30 close 08/12/2016 (53% premium cited); $24.88 close 09/16/2016; Q3 2016 high $25.00 (p.71).')\\nr = S(r, 'Glossary', 'NDA = confidentiality/non-disclosure agreement. IOI = indication of interest (here non-binding, May\\\\u2013June 2016). LOI = letter of intent (here non-binding, July 2016). CVR = contingent value right ($1.13/share, tied to the South Quay property sale). Markup = proposed edits to transaction documents (not a signed agreement). STB = U.S. Surface Transportation Board. \\\\u201cFiduciary out\\\\u201d = the Board\\\\u2019s limited right to change its recommendation/accept a superior proposal before the shareholder vote; \\\\u201cmatching rights\\\\u201d = G&W\\\\u2019s right to match such a proposal. Voting trust = mechanism to hold the surviving corporation\\\\u2019s shares pending STB approval. Round 0 = pre-opening stage; \\\\u201cpost\\\\u201d = post-signing.')\\nr = S(r, 'Workbook notes', 'Deal column value: PWRR-G&W. AI original (hidden) stores a values-only copy of the Deal ledger baseline; red-bold conditional formatting highlights any later change per Row id and column. Include = No excludes a row from Summary SUMIFS. Source links open the cited paragraph on the Source text sheet. This first pass has no reviewer edits yet.')\\n\\nws_sum.column_dimensions['A'].width = 30\\nws_sum.column_dimensions['B'].width = 150\\nws_sum.column_dimensions['C'].width = 14\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# QUESTIONS SHEET\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nQH = ['Q','Review topic','Recommended answer','Why and source','Affected rows/fields','Consequence of changing it','Status','Reviewer note']\\nwrite_header(ws_que, QH)\\nQUESTIONS = [\\n ('Q1','Process and round map (one process; four stages and rejected anchor candidates)',\\n  'Adopt one process (Process 1) with Round 0 (Q4 2015\\\\u201303/27/2016), Round 1 anchored on the week-of-03/28/2016 outreach, Round 2 from the 06/01/2016 advancement, Round 3 from the 07/27/2016 selection (Inferred final), plus post-signing events. Keep R003 and R005 as rejected Round 1 anchor candidates.',\\n  'No abandonment, dormancy or restart is reported between the Q4 2015 approach and signing; the contacts run continuously (P-002\\\\u2013P-023). The first solicitation is the wave itself (P-006, p.28); the 03/24 authorization and 03/14 decision are earlier decision points kept as separate rows so the boundary can be moved.',\\n  'R001, R003, R005, R006, R021, R037 (process/round; Round finality)',\\n  'Moving the R1 anchor to R003/R005 changes the round in which the initial outreach sits and the stage counts; splitting into two processes would require evidence of abandonment/restart that the filing does not report.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q2','Deadline history: 05/19 treatment, 07/20 late acceptance, and the undated late-July LOI window',\\n  'Keep 05/10 Extended, 05/19 Enforced, 07/20 Late bids accepted. Keep the five undated late-July LOIs on Working date 07/20 with Date from/to 07/20\\\\u201307/27 and note that arrivals were probably 07/20\\\\u201307/22 but that window is not entered as a bound.',\\n  '05/10 was postponed (P-010, p.29). The nine IOIs arrived 05/19\\\\u201306/01 and the process advanced 06/01 (P-011, p.29); the receipt window merely straddles the 05/19 date and no individual arrival is dated after it \\\\u2014 the instruction treats a straddling window as not late, so Enforced; a reviewer preferring Late bids accepted for 05/19 would change R017/R016 treatment. G&W\\\\u2019s 07/21 LOI was considered (P-017, p.29; P-023, p.30) \\\\u2014 Late bids accepted for 07/20. The 07/27 meeting compared all six LOIs (P-023), so every undated LOI is established received by 07/27.',\\n  'R015, R016, R017, R018, R022, R027, R028\\\\u2013R032 (Due date; Deadline treatment; Date from/to; Working date)',\\n  'Changing 05/19 to Late bids accepted would relabel the R017 milestone and the Summary deadline map; there is no evidence to extend or revise the 07/20 date.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q3','NDA population (25 vs 26), contact reconciliation, and unresolved overlaps',\\n  'Record 11 strategic + 14 financial signers for the March\\\\u2013April wave and Party C separately (26 signer events); treat the Reasons section\\\\u2019s \\\\u201c25\\\\u201d as the wave (or as an inconsistency) and flag the one-unit difference. Party B\\\\u2019s contact Count remains blank; the two additional Class I railroads never entered; the two non-submitting LOI bidders are from the seven-plus-Party-C stage population.',\\n  'Wave narrative 11 strategic + 14 financial = 25 (P-006, p.28); Reasons says \\\\u201c25 of whom entered into confidentiality agreements\\\\u2026 and six of whom submitted non-binding letters of intent\\\\u201d (X-001, p.33) while the six LOIs include Party C, whose July CA is separately described (P-014, p.29). Party B\\\\u2019s cohort membership is not disclosed (P-008, p.28). Two Class I railroads were approached but no NDA/bid is reported (P-008). One strategic and one financial buyer elected not to submit an LOI (P-022, p.30).',\\n  'R007\\\\u2013R010, R013, R014, R024, R025, R033, R034 (Count; population descriptions)',\\n  'Deciding the 25 includes Party C would reduce the wave signers to 24 and change R009/R010 Counts and both Summary totals; treating Party B as inside the wave would allow Count 1 on R014.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q4','Bidder types and anonymity (A\\\\u2013F, cohorts) \\\\u2014 no outside identification used',\\n  'Keep the filing\\\\u2019s role-based types: A, B, C, E, F and G&W Strategic; D Financial; the nine-IOI cohort, the two excluded bidders, the 16 non-submitters Unknown; the two non-submitting LOI bidders split Strategic/Financial as the filing supplies. Do not attempt to name any anonymous party.',\\n  'Party A is a \\\\u201cClass I rail partner\\\\u201d (P-002, p.27); B and C are \\\\u201cpotential strategic buyer[s]\\\\u201d (P-008, p.28; P-014, p.29); D is \\\\u201ca financial buyer\\\\u201d (P-019, p.30); E and F are \\\\u201ca strategic buyer\\\\u201d (P-018, P-021, p.30); G&W operates railroads (X-014, p.21). The nine-IOI group and residuals carry no usable type evidence.',\\n  'R001, R014, R023\\\\u2013R025, R028\\\\u2013R036, R042 (Type; identity descriptions)',\\n  'Reassigning any type would change Summary participant lines and could affect cohort splits; naming anonymous parties from outside knowledge is out of scope by instruction.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q5','Inferred/closing outcomes and their agency (every inferred row grouped by transition)',\\n  'Accept the closures: R019 (Did not submit, Inferred: residual \\\\u2014 25 \\\\u2212 9 = 16, working 05/19) and R033/R034 (stated non-submissions, by 07/20); R042 (Party A, Inferred: identity, Count 0, first named set excluding it 07/27); R054/R055 (D and E, Inferred: silent at the 08/12 signing). D\\\\u2019s 08/02 statement is treated as Participation paused, not an exit.',\\n  'Bases and arithmetic are in section 10.2 of the instruction and each row\\\\u2019s Why cell: R019 uses the 25-signer base and nine submitters (P-006, p.28; P-011, p.29); R042 uses the 07/27 continuation of \\\\u201cG&W and Party B\\\\u201d (P-023, p.30); D/E last appear 08/02 and the next identified transition is signing (P-024, p.30; P-033, p.32). The filing does not state who the two lowest IOIs were or which anonymous exit was Party A\\\\u2019s.',\\n  'R019, R020, R033, R034, R042, R048, R054, R055 (Outcome basis; Count; Decided by; Exit reason)',\\n  'If the 25-signer base or the nine-submitter set is corrected, R019\\\\u2019s Count and the Round 1 balance change; if Party A is instead mapped to a named exit, only R042\\\\u2019s covering-row list changes \\\\u2014 counts must not move to the name.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q6','Formality and conditions borderline calls (including the late reconfirmation and every diligence-period Heavy)',\\n  'Keep: nine-IOI cohort Informal/Heavy by context (R018); Party C IOI Informal/Heavy (R025); B\\\\u2019s LOI and reaffirmation Formal/Light with \\\\u201cDD required: confirmatory\\\\u201d mapping an expedited diligence review (R028, R050; R050 is a flagged late reconfirmation \\\\u2014 Reaffirmed by: returned draft, $24 carried forward); E\\\\u2019s LOIs/reversion Informal/Heavy with the 60-day exclusivity (R029, R046, R047); D Formal/Heavy (R030, R045); C and F Informal/Heavy (R031, R032); G&W Formal/Heavy for the July bids and Formal/Light for the final $25.00 bid with no diligence condition (R035, R036, R052).',\\n  'Formal signals: B, G&W and D returned agreement mark-ups (P-015, p.29); E provided only an issues summary (P-015); the final G&W bid carried mark-ups and was priced during definitive negotiation (P-028, p.31). Heavy triggers are stated multi-week/exclusive diligence periods (P-016\\\\u2013P-021, p.29\\\\u201330; P-024, p.30). B\\\\u2019s reaffirmation meets the three-part late-reconfirmation test (P-026/P-027, p.31).',\\n  'R018, R025, R028\\\\u2013R036, R045\\\\u2013R050, R052 (Formality; Conditions level; Conditions detail; Price origin)',\\n  'A reviewer treating E\\\\u2019s issues summary as a returned markup would make E Formal; treating B\\\\u2019s expedited review as substantive would make B Heavy; either change alters the deal-history reading but not the outcome.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q7','Working-date conventions that decide row order (05/19 IOI window, mid-June, early-July Party C, the five undated LOIs vs G&W 07/21, deadline-revision window, 07/29 re-entries)',\\n  'Keep the assigned Working dates and the disclosed methods: R018 05/19 (Assigned: deadline); R022 06/15 (midpoint of 06/11\\\\u201319); R023/R024 07/05 (midpoint of 07/01\\\\u201310; R024 Assigned: sequence); R028\\\\u2013R032 07/20 (Assigned: deadline) displayed before G&W\\\\u2019s 07/21 exact LOI \\\\u2014 their relative order is not known and is a display convention only; R016 05/08 (midpoint of the derived 04/28\\\\u201305/18 window); R038\\\\u2013R042 07/27 (Assigned: decision day).',\\n  'The instruction\\\\u2019s date rules and the filing\\\\u2019s own sequencing (P-010, P-012, P-014\\\\u2013P-017, P-023). Example: the five undated LOIs cannot be shown to have arrived before G&W\\\\u2019s 07/21 LOI or after their 07/20 deadline; the ledger sorts them at the deadline and says so (R028\\\\u2013R032).',\\n  'R016, R018, R022\\\\u2013R034, R038\\\\u2013R044 (Working date; Date basis; Date method; # order)',\\n  'Moving any assigned date within its own window would change # order and possibly stage counts; reported and inferred dates are not moved.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n ('Q8','Post-signing matters, contingent consideration and comparability inputs',\\n  'Keep the 09/06/2016 BMO conflict row as a Material process update (R058); keep the CVR ($1.13/share, South Quay) only in G&W\\\\u2019s July bid rows and the Summary; keep the preferred 100-for-1 conversion and the labelled $2,500 per preferred share conversion in the Summary; no go-shop and no observed post-signing competing proposal.',\\n  'Background p.32 (P-034) and the financial-analysis Miscellaneous section (X-006/X-007, p.41\\\\u201342: ~5% affiliate participation; $1\\\\u20135 million revenue since 01/01/2014). CVR defined in P-017, p.29. Consideration X-008, p.50. No go-shop provision appears in the merger-agreement summaries reviewed.',\\n  'R035, R036, R052, R056, R058 (Terms; All cash; Cash at closing; Summary comparability)',\\n  'Treating the CVR as non-cash or ignoring the BMO relationship would misstate G&W\\\\u2019s July consideration or the adviser-conflict record; the preferred conversion changes only the Summary conversion, not per-common-share bids.',\\n  'Pending',''),\\n]\\nqr = 2\\nfor qrow in QUESTIONS:\\n    for c, v in enumerate(qrow, start=1):\\n        cell = put(ws_que, qr, c, v)\\n    if qrow[6] == 'Pending':\\n        ws_que.cell(row=qr, column=7).alignment = WRAP_C\\n    ws_que.row_dimensions[qr].height = 150\\n    qr += 1\\nqr += 1\\nws_que.cell(row=qr, column=1, value='SECTION 13 CHECK RESULTS (run on this delivered version)').font = BOLD\\nqr += 1\\nCHECKS = [\\n ('1. Coverage and materiality','Passed with qualifications','All disclosed core offers, contacts/NDAs, selections, outcomes, deadlines, signing and publicity are represented (R001\\\\u2013R058). Qualifications: no go-shop exists and no post-signing competition is reported, so none appears; contact-only parties (two Class I railroads) and never-admitted parties have no outcome rows by convention. Routine meetings were folded into related rows.'),\\n ('2. Counts and population','Qualified','Ledger formulas: contacts 33 units; NDA signers 26 events; round-bidder tallies 9 / 6 / 4. Filing assertions retained: 11+18 contacted; 25 NDA signers; nine IOIs; six LOIs. Unresolved: 25 vs 26 signer reconciliation (Q3) and Party B\\\\u2019s blank contact Count. Per-stage balance shown in Summary section 5; alternative counts are qualified rather than forced.'),\\n ('3. Participation continuity','Passed with qualifications','Every entered participant ends in a stated outcome, an inferred closing row, or signing; re-entries recorded for D/E (R043\\\\u2013R044). Qualifications: Party A\\\\u2019s exit is a Count-0 identity row (Q5), and the two non-submitting LOI bidders and 16 non-submitters are anonymous residuals. Stock per stage: R1 25\\\\u221216\\\\u22122=7; R2 8\\\\u22122\\\\u22124=2; R3 2+2\\\\u22123=1 (winner).'),\\n ('4. Dates and order','Passed (programmatic)','Sorting by Working date then # reproduces # order (verified by code); no Working date falls outside its own Date from/to; Reported/Inferred labels match Date basis; deadline communication, deadlines and signing are distinct. Application-level date checking (Excel recalculation) not performed.'),\\n ('5. Offers and classifications','Passed with qualifications','Every Bid and Bid reaffirmed row has Formality, Conditions level and a fixed-format Conditions detail string (verified by code); price kinds/origins, currencies and cash flags agree with the text; signing, reaffirmations, reversions and group envelope are not counted as separate priced submissions. Qualifications: Q6 borderline calls (E\\\\u2019s issues-summary formality; mapping expedited review to confirmatory).'),\\n ('6. Structure and consistency','Passed (programmatic)','Each numbered round has exactly one Round opened row (R006, R021, R037) with a Round finality value; R006 carries the R1 anchor tag with rejected candidates; every Deadline row has a treatment matching the Summary map; every inferred row opens with its Outcome basis; Page is filled wherever Source is; Date basis/Date method pairs are permitted.'),\\n ('7. Evidence','Passed with declared normalization','Every quotation in Why and evidence was checked programmatically as an exact substring of its cited Source text paragraph (curly quotes and whitespace normalized only at layout level). Interpretation over and above the quotations (rounds, conventions, agency) is argued in the cells and Questions. Text matching alone is not proof of interpretation.'),\\n ('8. Review and workbook operation','Qualified','Question links and affected rows resolve to defined Row ids; validations reference the Lists sheet; AI original matches the ledger baseline (row-by-row value comparison by Row id performed); conditional formatting highlights changes by Row id/column. Not performed in Excel: formula recalculation, drop-down and hyperlink behavior, and print/layout inspection; a LibreOffice open/save smoke test was used where available.'),\\n]\\nfor name, status, note in CHECKS:\\n    put(ws_que, qr, 1, name).font = BOLD\\n    put(ws_que, qr, 2, status)\\n    put(ws_que, qr, 3, note)\\n    ws_que.merge_cells(start_row=qr, start_column=3, end_row=qr, end_column=8)\\n    ws_que.row_dimensions[qr].height = 78\\n    qr += 1\\nws_que.column_dimensions['A'].width = 8\\nws_que.column_dimensions['B'].width = 34\\nws_que.column_dimensions['C'].width = 52\\nws_que.column_dimensions['D'].width = 52\\nws_que.column_dimensions['E'].width = 30\\nws_que.column_dimensions['F'].width = 40\\nws_que.column_dimensions['G'].width = 10\\nws_que.column_dimensions['H'].width = 24\\nws_que.freeze_panes = 'A2'\\n\\n# workbook properties\\nwb.properties.title = 'PWRR / G&W deal ledger (SEC Dealer Ledger Extraction, Pro revision 19 Sep 2026)'\\nwb.properties.creator = 'AI extraction first pass'\\nwb.properties.description = 'Extraction from DEFM14A filed 2016-09-20 (Providence & Worcester / Genesee & Wyoming).'\\n\\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT), exist_ok=True)\\nwb.save(OUT)\\nprint('saved', OUT, 'rows', len(ROWS))\\n\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824833993,"end":1789824943710}}}}
