{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825012998,"sessionID":"ses_f4629b1bbffezZEiat5kIdVPT6","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e244bc001b2ztGgt8TcY3NW","sessionID":"ses_f4629b1bbffezZEiat5kIdVPT6","messageID":"msg_0b9e22fde001hxxABPbbE7sbOk","type":"tool","id":"call_00_UP9ag4TPIVBAuKb98aZV3893","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"r = S(r, 'Contact tally (ledger-derived)', 'Ledger Count sum: Contact rows = 31 (R007 11 + R008 18 + R013 2, plus R004/R011 at Count 0) plus the two Bidder interest rows that carry first-contact tallies (R001 = 1; R023 = 1) = 33 contact-count units. Composition: 29 initial wave + 2 additional Class I railroads + Party A first contact + Party C inbound. Party B\\u2019s contact (R014) carries no Count because its membership in the wave cohort is not disclosed. Distinct prospective buyers contacted: 32 (Party A is counted once inside the 29 and again only as the earlier first contact). Filing assertions: 11 strategic + 18 financial contacted; 2 additional Class I railroads approached. The formula below makes the two Bidder interest inclusions explicit.')\nws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Contact\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")+SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bidder interest\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")')","oldString":"r = S(r, 'Contact tally (ledger-derived)', 'Ledger Count sum over Contact rows: 33 contact-count units \\u2014 29 initial wave (R007+R008) + 2 additional Class I railroads (R013) + Party A first contact (R001) + Party C inbound (R023). Party B\\u2019s contact (R014) carries no Count because its membership in the wave cohort is not disclosed. Distinct prospective buyers contacted: 32 (Party A is counted once inside the 29 and again only as the earlier first contact). Filing assertions: 11 strategic + 18 financial contacted; 2 additional Class I railroads approached.')\nws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'