1 strategic + 18 financial contacted; 2 additional Class I railroads approached.')\n-ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Contact\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")')\n+r = S(r, 'Contact tally (ledger-derived)', 'Ledger Count sum: Contact rows = 31 (R007 11 + R008 18 + R013 2, plus R004/R011 at Count 0) plus the two Bidder interest rows that carry first-contact tallies (R001 = 1; R023 = 1) = 33 contact-count units. Composition: 29 initial wave + 2 additional Class I railroads + Party A first contact + Party C inbound. Party B\\u2019s contact (R014) carries no Count because its membership in the wave cohort is not disclosed. Distinct prospective buyers contacted: 32 (Party A is counted once inside the 29 and again only as the earlier first contact). Filing assertions: 11 strategic + 18 financial contacted; 2 additional Class I railroads approached. The formula below makes the two Bidder interest inclusions explicit.')\n+ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Contact\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")+SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bidder interest\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")')\n r = S(r, 'NDA tally (ledger-derived)', 'Ledger Count sum over NDA signed rows: 26 signer events \\u2014 11 strategic signers (R009) + 14 financial signers (R010) + Party C (R024). Filing assertion: 25 confidentiality agreements in the Reasons section (X-001, p.33). Reconciliation: the narrative\\u2019s 11 + 14 = 25 is the March\\u2013April wave; Party C executed its agreement in early July after approaching the Company (R023\\u2013R024). 26 \\u2212 25 = 1 = Party C; unresolved whether the Reasons\\u2019 25 includes or excludes Party C (Q3).')\n ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"NDA signed\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")')\n r = S(r, 'Round-bidder tallies (ledger-derived)', 'Stage-spe