asons section (X-001, p.33). Reconciliation: the narrative\\u2019s 11 + 14 = 25 is the March\\u2013April wave; Party C executed its agreement in early July after approaching the Company (R023\\u2013R024). 26 \\u2212 25 = 1 = Party C; unresolved whether the Reasons\\u2019 25 includes or excludes Party C (Q3).')\n743: ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"NDA signed\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")')\n744: r = S(r, 'Round-bidder tallies (ledger-derived)', 'Stage-specific submitters/reaffirmers (not unique firms): Round 1 = 9 (R018 envelope cohort); Round 2 = 6 (B R028, E R029, D R030, C R025 and F R032 at Count 1, G&W R035); Round 3 = 4 (D R045, E R046, B R050, G&W R052). Formulas sum Count for Bid and Bid reaffirmed rows by Round, excluding Include = No.')\n745: ws_sum.cell(row=r-1, column=3, value='=SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$F:$F,\"1\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\") & \" / \" & (SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$F:$F,\"2\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")+SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$F:$F,\"2\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bid reaffirmed\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")) & \" / \" & (SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$F:$F,\"3\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")+SUMIFS(\\'Deal ledger\\'!$Q:$Q,\\'Deal ledger\\'!$F:$F,\"3\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$D:$D,\"Bid reaffirmed\",\\'Deal ledger\\'!$P:$P,\"Yes\"))')\n746: r = S(r, 'Per-stage balance', 'Round 1: 25 signers \\u2212 16 inferred non-submitters (R019) \\u2212 2 stated exclusions (R020) = 7 continuing (R021). Round 2: 7 continuing + 1 late entrant (Party C) = 8; \\u2212 2 stated non-submitters (R033\\u2013R034) \\u2212 4 stated drops (R038\\u2013R041) = 2 continuing (R037). Round 3: 2 + 2 re-entries (R043\\u2013R044) \\u2212 3 closures (R053\\u2013R055) = 1 winner (G&W). Inferred share of exits